<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2KI" style="id">- Zeme(N) Bible Project</book>
  <para style="toc3">2 Heg.</para>
  <para style="toc2">Hegwangme Kenabe</para>
  <para style="toc1">Hegwangme Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="mt">2 Kings</para>
  <para style="mt">Hegwangme Laisiukwak Kenabe</para>
  <para style="is">Mraisam</para>
  <para style="ip">Hegwangme Kenabe caihakeci kedibe kena Elijah penai Elisha ga rang redwa gai. Cide hegwangram nreube Israel penai hegwangram ngkangbe Judah ha penaide kamtule mina gwateu kedi kecang ha ranggai. Israel de 722 BC bekum Assyrianme ne gwalu nah Judah de Babylonme ne 586 BC dau gwalu. Hegwangram kena ga Tinggwang caihakecime minadung dage penui mau gade helungnreulu mecai Tinggwang penuide saja peu kera mrairang gaibeu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Pelung ga keladung</para>
  <para style="io1">Elijah penai Elisha (1:1-8:15)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel nah Judah gwangpeidung (8:16-17:6)</para>
  <para style="io1">Israel Assyria baang teikedi (17:7-41)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah au Assyriame kangga lungh kelu (18:1-23:37)</para>
  <para style="io1">Judah de Babylonia baangkedi (24:1-25:30)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2KI 1" />
  <para style="s">RAMPAUBE Ahaziah de kemmau</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 1:1" />Ahab tsai kedicai Moab Israel de reniadi. <verse eid="2KI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 1:2" />Pecai Ahaziah Samaria ga pe kibung reu ga riepwa kebam gade cakmie, nah rejam di. Cine pa samgwame langgai nah penui dage rang, “Mie delwe Baal-Zebub, Ekron rabe de keteu lo, Ih aipau rejam gade yi mi yi gailak bi kecu.” <verse eid="2KI 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 1:3" />Dede RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame Tishbeme Elijah dage rang, “Cuhlu, Samaria gwangpei samgwamedung de redau kera nghang lo, nah penuide keteu lo, ‘Israel ga Tinggwang gah kecu ziemne nang Ekron rabe, Baal-Zebub dade ma keteu lai eh lani? <verse eid="2KI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 1:4" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE rangzeu, “Nang cuh kelu zeulie gade nghung dailak ta; meliene, nang tsai bi zie da.”’” Pecai Elijah tetti.<verse eid="2KI 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 1:5" />Samgwame Ahaziah da cailigwanglu ge, pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daitei eh cailigwang lano?” <verse eid="2KI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 1:6" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Mipei ge anuide redau kera gwang eh pa anui dage ranggai, ‘Nnuide lang kegaibe hegwangpei da cailigwang cu, delwe pe dage ranglo, “RAMPAUBE aide rangla: ‘Israel ga Tinggwang gah kecu ziemne nang Ekron rabe, Baal-Zebub dage ma keteu kera mina langgai lani? Ciziemne nang zeu kebam zeulie de gade nghung dailakta; meliene, nang tsaibi zie da.’”’” <verse eid="2KI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 1:7" />Ahaziah pe samgwame dage rangdi, “N da gwang eh aipau samdung de kerangbe de daikenzwa kauge no?” <verse eid="2KI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 1:8" />Penui pecu keligai, “Pa tam le tei kelu pai ge ba la nah teigeu kiakang le pe kia nkang pwala.” Cine hegwangpei keligai, “Cide au Tishbe mepei Elijah da.”<verse eid="2KI 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 1:9" />Pecai hegwangpei kedime ge de reugwame riakngei si eh Elijah da langgai. Kedibe Elijah da pa hangdeutu ga ntum kebam ga nghang. Kedibe pecu resiu, “Nang, Tinggwang gu mina, hegwangpei rangzeu, ‘Nghunglu.’” <verse eid="2KI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 1:10" />Elijah keli eh kedibe dage rangdi, “Ih Tinggwang mina ge liecai, peu tinggim gade mi cak mie eh ncu nah n minadung riakngei de ngkapti lu.” Pecai tinggim gade mi cak mie eh pecu nah pe minadung riakngei de ngkapti.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="REV 11:5">Keu. 11:5</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 1:11" />Hegwangpei Ahaziah kedime keda ge reugwame riakngei si eh Elijah da langgai dai. Kedibe aide de Elijah da rang, “Nang, Tinggwang gu mina, hegwangpei rangbam, ‘Zette nghunglu.’” <verse eid="2KI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 1:12" />Elijah keligai nah penui dage rang, “Ih au Tinggwang mina ge liecai, peu tinggim gade mi cak mie eh ncu nah n minadung riakngei de ngkapti lu.” Ge Tinggwang gu mi de tinggim gade cak mie dai eh pecu nah pe minadung riakngei de ngkapdi. <verse eid="2KI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 1:13" />Dede hegwangpei reugwame riakngei maa pe kecumbe langgai dai. Kedibe aide hang eh, Elijah dwa kwaktunglu, nah pe da penggia kia eh pedage ranggai, “Nang, Tinggwang minabo, Ih nda de kiela, a teilung nah n kilame riakngei aidungde teilung keli beulo. <verse eid="2KI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 1:14" />Kesang, tinggim gade mi cak mie eh kedibe keraibe kena de nah penai minadung de si eh ngkapdi, dede cu a teilung keli beulo.” <verse eid="2KI 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 1:15" />RAMPAUBE tinggimgwame Elijah dage rang, “Pecu ngngwa nghung lu. Pecu hing so.” Cine Elijah cuhlu delwe pecu ngngwa hegwangpei da mie. <verse eid="2KI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 1:16" />Pecaine Elijah Ahaziah dage rang, “Aide RAMPAUBE ne rang, ‘Ekron rabe Baal-Zebub dage ma keteu kera nang samgwame de langgai. Israel ga Tinggwang gah kecu ziemne ni nang pe dade ma keteu lu kera? Cine cu, nang cuh kelu zeulie gade nghung dailak ta; nang tsai bi zie da.’”<verse eid="2KI 1:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 1:17" />Hegwangpei Ahaziah tsaidi Elijah ne RAMPAUBE sam rangkegai nzwa eh. Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat napei Jehoram hegwang tei kelu mmi kena bekum Joram pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu, kedanemene Ahaziah pe napei gah kecune. <verse eid="2KI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 1:18" />Ahaziah ma kedadung teikedi be au, Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwa meni?<verse eid="2KI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2KI 2" />
  <para style="s">Elijah de Tinggim teucuh kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 2:1" />Iciu eh RAMPAUBE Elijah de tingkai gade tinggim ngngwa nghangdi kera dau, Elijah Elisha de ngngwa Gilgal gade tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 2:2" />Elijah Elisha dage rangdi, “Kehereide, aika bamlu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE acu Bethel gage langgai.” Elisha keli eh, “RAMPAUBE ring kebam nzwa, nah nang lung kebam tane, Ih ncu püt dilak.” Cine penai Bethel ga miedi. <verse eid="2KI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 2:3" />Caihakecime maa ge Bethel ga kebamme Elisha da gwang eh pe dage rangdi, “Nang RAMPAUBE n dade n mpaube de henai ngngwa tetti kera de cibam mi?” Elisha keli eh, “Yeo, Ih cibam, dede cide ha rang so.” <verse eid="2KI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 2:4" />Elijah pe dage rangdi, “Elisha, Kehereide, aika kwalu, kedanemene RAMPAUBE acu Jericho gage lang kegai ne.” Pecai Elisha keli eh, “RAMPAUBE ring kebam nzwa, nah nang lungh kebam tane, Ih ncu püt dilak.” Cine penai Jericho ga miedi. <verse eid="2KI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 2:5" />Pecai Jericho ga kebam caihakecime maa Elisha da gwang eh pe dage rangdi, “Nang RAMPAUBE n dade n mpaube de henai ngngwa tetti kera de cibam mi?” Elisha keli eh, “Yeo, Ih cibam, dede cide ha rang so.” <verse eid="2KI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 2:6" />Ge Elijah pe dage rangdi, “Kehereide, aika bam lulo, kedanemene RAMPAUBE acu Jordan gage langgai au lu.” Elisha keligai, “RAMPAUBE ring kela zi gade, nah nang ring kebam zi gade, Ih ncu püt dilak lie rang gaila.” Cine penai tetgai. <verse eid="2KI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 2:7" />Pecai, kemdei gega caihakecime maa hang riakngei ge penai Jordan ga sap kebam gade penaide mcwalu eh bam. <verse eid="2KI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 2:8" />Elijah pe pai pwalu, hedui nghang lu, nah cide le hedui gage dap gai. Kereuki kenana lam mzi tsamlu ciu eh penai hangnana hangdeu kecangh ga tet ludi. <verse eid="2KI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 2:9" />Cinzwa eh, penai kahpet lu caine, Elijah Elisha dage rangdi, “N dade acu ngngwa tet kedi dwa acu peu n ziemne dai tei neu labi adage ranggai lo.” Elisha keli eh, “Kehereide a da n kengkieng kena kieege peu gwanglo.” <verse eid="2KI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 2:10" />Elijah keli eh, “Nang kie kegai de au tei paa kera ge. Dede, acu n dade ngngwa tet kecudau nang acu ngau cai, aide n da tei beuzie, dede acu ngau mecai, aide tei beulak.” <verse eid="2KI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 2:11" />Penai tet eh resiu kebam dau, ainie, miheu bagi ge nah miheu kwen ge ngau di, cide ne hangge ge dade penai hangna de teu ntsamdi, nah Elijah tingkai gade tinggim ga nghangdi. <verse eid="2KI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 2:12" />Elisha cide ngaulu delwe sahbak eh cu, “A pei, A pei, Israel bagidung nah penui hekwen keteube!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 2:12">Pa Elijah de ngau si tadi, nah pa peniadung kerak lu nah cidung hiet kena teidi. <verse eid="2KI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 2:13" />Pa Elijah pai pe dade cak mie kecude pwalu, delwe cailigwang Jordan reukung ga saplu. <verse eid="2KI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 2:14" />Pa Elijah pai cak mie kecude pwa dui gage dap nah rangdi, “Daiga RAMPAUBE, Elijah Tinggwang lano?” Pa dui dap kegaidau, cide kenana lam mzi tsamlu nah Elisha kah petdi.<verse eid="2KI 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 2:15" />Jericho gade kegwang caihakecime maa penui kemdei gade pecu ngau keludau, penui rangdi, “Elijah rabe Elisha da bam dida!” Cine penui pecu redau kera gwanglu, delwe penui pe dwaga hangdeu ga keumielu. <verse eid="2KI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 2:16" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Cu pielo, nnui kilame kakga mipei kengkieng hang riakngei bam. Anui kie, penuide peu mie eh n mpaube de RAMPAUBE Rabe pecu ngngwa nghanglu eh pecu lamlwatu kesa gage mede kesa langkam gega kelien gai pwabam memi peu pielo.” Elisha keli eh, “Lak, penuide langgai so.” <verse eid="2KI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 2:17" />Dede penui keibi kedine Elisha laklie dau lakdi, pa rangdi, “Penuide lang gailu.” Pecai penui mina hang riakngei de langgai, nah penui langcum ne peei, dede pecu ngau luma. <verse eid="2KI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 2:18" />Pa Jericho ga kebam dau, penui Elisha da cailigwang, nah pa penui da rangdi, “Ih nnui da rang meni, ‘Mie helo’?”<verse eid="2KI 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Dui teimmi kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 2:19" />Namdi be ga mina Elisha dage rangdi, “Pielo, anui n da kiela, a mpaube ngau kebam nzwa, aipau namdi be peting be au yi bam, dede dui au sia nah hangdeu ga ma lungyi ma.” <verse eid="2KI 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 2:20" />Elisha keli eh, “Hekwak keheci gage mcai kailwe cide a da pwa gwang beulo,” cine penui cide pe da keu gwangbeu. <verse eid="2KI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 2:21" />Elisha dui rwak ga mie nah mcai de dui gage kelien gaidi; pecai pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Ih dui aide tei mci dida. Cu ting gade, ketsai mede hangdeu yi kemak bam si lakta.’” <verse eid="2KI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 2:22" />Cine cipau cai benai dui cide mci ladi, Elisha sam rang kebeu de nzwa eh.<verse eid="2KI 2:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha de henui teikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 2:23" />Pecai Elisha cikade Bethel ga nghangdi. Pa lampuiki gade nghang keladau, hename ge namdi be gade mpet eh pecu henui tei; penui pe dage rangdi, “Nghang cu, nang peukwakbo! Nghang cu, nang peukwakbo!” <verse eid="2KI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 2:24" />Elisha pecai nreu gwang pie eh penuide ngau; pa RAMPAUBE de penuide reset kera qugai. Ge hegumpui kena hegung gade mpet eh mipeina hang riakdai kena de rejamdi. <verse eid="2KI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 2:25" />Pecai Elisha cikade Carmel Deutu gage tet gaidi, nah cikade pa Samaria ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2KI 2:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2KI 3" />
  <para style="s">Moab mlaikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 3:1" />Cu Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum, Ahab napei Joram Samaria ga Israel reu hegwang tei cudi; mmi kereiekena pa hegwang tei gwang. <verse eid="2KI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 3:2" />RAMPAUBE dwa gade pa kemau teidi, dede pe pei nah pe pui nzwa kemau tei cang mah; kedanemene pe pei tei kegai Baal de kereca tsusum pa keugi kedine. <verse eid="2KI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 3:3" />Dede Nebat napei Jeroboam Israel de kemau ketei ga ngngwa gai kedibe maudung de pa de tei lala; cide gade pa nghim dima.<verse eid="2KI 3:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 3:4" />Cu Moab gwangpei Mesha meurünna guila. Pa Israel gwangpei dage meurünna 100,000 ge, nah meurün mai 100,000 ge gu habeu. <verse eid="2KI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 3:5" />Dede Ahab tsai kedicai, Moab gwangpei Israel gwangpei de renia cudi. <verse eid="2KI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 3:6" />Cine cipau tingdau hegwangpei Joram Israelme de hereu ziemne mteilu kerane Samaria gade tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 3:7" />Pa Jehoshaphat Judah gwangpei dage sam ge lang eh, ranggai, “Moab gwangpei acu renia cu dida. Moab da hereu tei kera nang acu ngngwa mie ziemi?” Jehoshaphat keli eh, “Ih mie zie. Ih de nang nzwa da, a mina de n mina da, a hekündung n hekündung da.” <verse eid="2KI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 3:8" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Daipau lampui gade anui gwaketang lai?” Jehoshaphat keli eh, “Edom gu hetaideu lampui gade.” <verse eid="2KI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 3:9" />Cine Israel gwangpei Judah gwangpei nah Edom gwangpei de ngngwa mie. Penui lang henane tet ladi, nah cine penuide nzang kela reugwame ziemne mede makaunedung ziemne dui gahdi. <verse eid="2KI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 3:10" />Cine Israel gwangpei rangdi, “Aide dai no? RAMPAUBE hegwang kecum de qu kecude penuide Moab kangga kai di kerane ni?” <verse eid="2KI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 3:11" />Dede Jehoshaphat rangdi, “Anui RAMPAUBE dade ma keteulu kera RAMPAUBE gu caihakecime ge de aika gah ni?” Israel kilame gwangpei hangge keli eh rangdi, “Elijah ba gage dui rui kegai be, Shaphat napei Elisha aika bam.” <verse eid="2KI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 3:12" />Jehoshaphat rangdi, “RAMPAUBE sam au pe da la.” Cine Israel gwangpei, Jehoshaphat, nah Edom gwangpei pe da miedi.<verse eid="2KI 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 3:13" />Elisha Israel gwangpei dage rangdi, “Ih n dage daipai teigai swa laino? N pui nah n pei gu caihakecime da mielo.” Cine Israel gwangpei pe dage rangdi, “Lak, kedanemene RAMPAUBE aipau hegwang kecum de penuide Moab kangga kai di kerane qugai.” <verse eid="2KI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 3:14" />Elisha keligai, “Ih ring kela Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE, Ih pe dwa sap kelabe, Ih Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat de rüt melie cai, Ih ncu ngngwa magede teilak, mede ncu pie de lak. <verse eid="2KI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 3:15" />Dede cu leiteikelame ge de a da ngngwa gwangbeu.” Pecai cide gwang leibung kekwabe lei kwa gai ge, RAMPAUBE ba Elisha reu ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2KI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 3:16" />Pa rangdi, “RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Kecangh kereuki langkam aide ga peu hekwaki le pui dilu.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 3:17" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE aide rangla, ‘Nang tingkai ngau lak, mede nang tingrui de ngau lak, dede kereuki langkam aide ga dui le pui dizie, nah nang nah n kauruine nah ngu kaune pelane dui sak luzie.’ <verse eid="2KI 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 3:18" />Aide au RAMPAUBE ziemne matei kerelui nage. Pa nnui de de Moabme reu kengkieng peu zie. <verse eid="2KI 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 3:19" />Nnui renei kwakelu namdi leu nah keyi namdi leune gwaketang zie, tsingbang keyibe leune dang dizie, dui rwak leune tei mtak dizie, nah hangdeu keyi leu tangtsudung le tei msia dizie.” <verse eid="2KI 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 3:20" />Cine tingcang ratak teibeu kera tingdau, Edom lam gade dui lwa mie; deudi dui le puidi.<verse eid="2KI 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 3:21" />Cidau Moabme pelane, hegwangmedung ne penuide renia kera gwangla lie siukelu dau, penui penuikatei gwang ngkwalu, hereunet punglu kebuime leune, nah penui herai ga gwang bamlu. <verse eid="2KI 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 3:22" />Penui tingcang nuge cuhlu nah tingnaimiak dui reu ga tau bam. Moabme penuide mcwa kebam dui de pie gaige, cide hejai nzwa gierei eh ngaudi. <verse eid="2KI 3:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 3:23" />Penui sahbak eh, “Aide au hejai! Hegwangmedung de tei ngkap bidi au zie da, nah penui hangge gede teitset dida! Cine cu, Moab, anui mielwe penuide hecung eh mapwa lugo!” <verse eid="2KI 3:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 3:24" />Penui Israelme ramzeuki ga gwang keludau, Moabme cimezing kebam gade Israelme penuide gwaketang eh, penui dwaga penui pak cudi. Israel reugwame Moabme deudung ga gwazui mie eh penuide teitset ladi. <verse eid="2KI 3:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 3:25" />Penui namdidung de ngkapdi, nah hangdeu keyi leu ga tangtsu le heling pui gai di kemaktane cide keliengai. Penui dui rwak leune tei mtak di nah tsingbang keyi leune dang gidi. Kir Hareseth rünne bang nzeu di pe tangtsudung pebam ga bam eh. Dede reugwamedung cide twagwapung delwe cide gwaketang. <verse eid="2KI 3:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 3:26" />Moab gwangpei Mesha hereu cide sia kedi ngaulu ge, pa kingtie pwa kelame mina hai hena gede ngngwa delwe Edom gwangpei de renia kera mie, dede penui teilu tadi. <verse eid="2KI 3:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 3:27" />Cine pa pe neraibe, pecai pebam pwa leu kerabe de ngngwalu, delwe pecu pwa kirie reu gage keru ratak teigai. Cine Israel ga rata le puidi, nah Israelme reugwame Mesha gwangpei dade tetdi delwe penui deu ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2KI 3:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2KI 4" />
  <para style="s">Hemipui ge gu maca</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 4:1" />Cu caihakecime napei hangge nau hap eh Elisha da gwang eh ranggai, “N kilabe a nahpei au tsai dida, nah n kilabe RAMPAUBE de rütkela nang ci. Cu pa pe paupung kelabe pe kila tei kerane a na hangnana de ngngwa teudi kera gwangla bam.” <verse eid="2KI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 4:2" />Cine Elisha pe dage rang, “Ih nziemne daipai tei lai? N kiga dai bam bi acu ranglia lo?” Pa rang eh, “N kilabe kiga au magede galie, maca bung ge gwale.” <verse eid="2KI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 4:3" />Pecai Elisha rang, “N kidame dade mie mabungdung releu teugwanglu, kemrwa bungdung. Ngaulu kebui kieege releulu. <verse eid="2KI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 4:4" />Delwe nang nah n napei kena kilung ga nlütlu nah kikam ngkui dilu, delwe maca mabung cidungde leune gage rui gailu; mabung puikedibe teu ntsam dilu.” <verse eid="2KI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 4:5" />Cine pa Elisha dade tetdi nah pa nah pe napei kena de ngngwa nlütlu eh kikam ngkuidi. Penai mabungdung pe da pwagwangbeu, nah pa maca le nli puilu. <verse eid="2KI 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 4:6" />Mabungdung puidi ge, pa pe napei dage ranggai, “Mabung kedabe ada pwagwanglo.” Dede pa pe dage rangdi, “Mabungdung bamsi me da.” Cidau maca lwakebam mtakdi. <verse eid="2KI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 4:7" />Pecai pa gwang nah Tinggwang mina de ranglia. Pa rang, “Miecu, maca de zwalu; hepau pungkela de ruidi, nah bangkelu de teu n name de ngngwa lunghlu.”<verse eid="2KI 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Shunemme napei gede teimring kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 4:8" />Tingnaige Elisha Shunem ga miedi, cika mipui kenlang ge lunghbam; pa pecu ngngwa ketaktyei kera qu bi. Cine Elisha cika tetkah kegwang tane, pa cika taktyei kera mtakla. <verse eid="2KI 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 4:9" />Cipau puide pe nahpei dage rang, “Pielo, mina aika gwang bam kelabe de Tinggwang gu kemci peige lie kecu cu Ih cisiakte bam dida. <verse eid="2KI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 4:10" />Elisha ziemne kireu gage hezeubung keceunage tei lugo anui, nah cikage zeu ge, kekaibam ge, bamrak, nah mitaubung ge kai lugo. Pecai pa anui da kegwang dau, pa cika bam luzie.” <verse eid="2KI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 4:11" />Cine Elisha cika gwang mtak dai kecu tingba dau, pa zeubung ga bamlu nah cika mtaklu. <verse eid="2KI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 4:12" />Elisha pe kilabe Gehazi dage rang, “Aipau Shunamme pui de qugai.” Pa pecu qu kegai dau, pa gwang pe dwaga saplu. <verse eid="2KI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 4:13" />Elisha pe dage rangdi, “Pecu rang beulo, ‘Nang keherei aikenzwa pungpwabeu anui reluilu kerane. N ziemne daige teibeu lai no? N ziemne hegwangpei mede reugwame reu muibe de anui resiu beu ziemi?’” Pa keligai, “Ih a minadung kakga lunghbam.” <verse eid="2KI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 4:14" />Cine Elisha rang, “Iciucai, anui pe ziemne dai teibeu lai no?” Gehazi keligai, “Kesang, pa pena mipeina gah, nah pe nahpei cing dida.” <verse eid="2KI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 4:15" />Cine Elisha keligai, “Pecu qugai.” Pa pecu qu kegai dau, pa kimuiki ga saplu. <verse eid="2KI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 4:16" />Elisha rang, “Mmi aipau hidau, mmi ge cia, nang mipeina gede n ba ga pwabam zie.” Pa rang, “Ma, a mpaubo nah Tinggwang minabe, n kilabe dade mret helo.”<verse eid="2KI 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 4:17" />Dede pecia bekum cipau hi tingsiak dau mipuibe tetlak lu nah mipeina ge de mnalu, Elisha pecu rang kebeu de nzwa eh. <verse eid="2KI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 4:18" />Henanabe ngking cuh keludau, tingnai ge pa pe pei taiga mie, luhlüt kebamme de ngngwa kebam ga. <verse eid="2KI 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 4:19" />Pa pe pei dage rang, “A peu, a peu.” Pe pei pe kilabe dage rang, “Pecu pepui da punggwang cu.” <verse eid="2KI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 4:20" />Kilabe pecu pwalu delwe pepui da ngngwa gwang kebeu dau, hena nabe pe nnie ga tingna kemaktane bamlu nah pecai tsaidi. <verse eid="2KI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 4:21" />Cine mipuibe cuhlu nah mipeina de Tinggwang minabe zeu gage kaidi, kikam ngkuidi, nah tet petdi. <verse eid="2KI 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 4:22" />Pa pe nahpei de qulu, delwe rang, “Kehereide kilame hangge nah gada ge a dage langgai beulo iciude Ih Tinggwang minabe da mie nzetlu kera nah gwang dailu kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 4:23" />Pe nahpei rangdi, “Nang daitei henai pe da mie neu lano? Hekei keheci de ma mede sabbath de ma.” Pa keligai, “Maduma.” <verse eid="2KI 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 4:24" />Pecai pa gada reuga bamlu nah pe kilabe dage rang, “Teupak nzet gailo; a ziemne pak nneu diso Ih rang kemaktane.” <verse eid="2KI 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 4:25" />Cine pa mie eh Carmel Deutu ga Tinggwang minabe da gwang.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 4:25">Cine Tinggwang minabe kemdei gade pecu ngau kegai dau, pa Gehazi pe kilabe dage rang, “Pielo, Shunamme pui de gwang lada. <verse eid="2KI 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 4:26" />Kehereide pak pet pecu daulu nah peda ranglo, ‘Nang nah n nahpei da nah n napei kena da maleune petau bam mi?’” Pa keligai, “Petau bam lie.” <verse eid="2KI 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 4:27" />Pa lamlwa ga Tinggwang minabe da gwang keludau, pa pe pi tuipung bamdi. Gehazi pecu niagidi kera gwang dede Tinggwang minabe rangdi, “Pecu püt dilo, kedanemene pa pelung keherei sütbam, nah RAMPAUBE a dade cipau lungrei de kebai pwabam, nah magede acu ranglia ma.” <verse eid="2KI 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 4:28" />Pecai pa rangdi, “A mpaubo, Ih nda de mipeina ge kie ni? ‘Acu cwa helo,’ de eh Ih rang meni?” <verse eid="2KI 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 4:29" />Pecai Elisha Gehazi dage rang, “Hebeuh tei kera ngunia kailu nah n ba ga a tuitie pwalu. Mipuibe kiga mie cu. Mina keheibede nang dau liede, pecu kelum so, nah keheibe ncu kelum liede, pecu sam keli so. Henana be zu gage a tuitie kai gailu.” <verse eid="2KI 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 4:30" />Dede hena nabe pui rang, “RAMPAUBE ringkebam nzwa, nah nang ringkebam nzwa, Ih ncu püt dilak.” Cine Elisha cuhlu delwe pe caisui tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 4:31" />Gehazi penai dwa kelwa gwang nah tuitie de henanabe zu gage kaigai, dede henanabe marang ma mede siu ma. Cine pecai Gehazi cailigwang Elisha de redau kera nah pecu ranglia, “Henanabe au nrak beu malie.”<verse eid="2KI 4:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 4:32" />Elisha kilung ga gwangcang kecudau, henanabe tsai bam nah zeu ga bam reu. <verse eid="2KI 4:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 4:33" />Cine Elisha nlütlu nah henanabe nah pecu kikam ngkuinam di nah RAMPAUBE da kekie tei.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:33 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAT 6:6">Mat. 6:6</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 4:34" />Pa henanabe reuga nghang zeulu; pa pemui henanabe mui gage, pe miak henanabe miak gage, nah pe ba kena de henanabe ba kena de gage kaigai. Pa henanabe reuga zeu gaige, henabe peina de pum lum gwangdi. <verse eid="2KI 4:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 4:35" />Pecai Elisha cuhlu delwe kibung tet huigai nah pa henabe peina de reuga nghang zeu dailu. Henabe peina de pia hena tangseugai ge pe miak nraklu! <verse eid="2KI 4:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 4:36" />Cine Elisha Gehazi de qugai nah rang, “Shunamme pui de qugai!” Cine pa pecu qugai, nah pa kibung ga nlwet kecudau, Elisha rang, “N napei de pwalu.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:36 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 7:15">Luk. 7:15</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 4:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 4:37" />Pecai pa hangdeu ga pe pi ga pezu pung mielu delwe hangdeu ga keumielu, nah pecai pe napei de pwalu delwe tetdi.<verse eid="2KI 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s">Li ga ketsai</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 4:38" />Pecai Elisha Gilgal ga gwang dai. Hangdeu ga herakum kum bam, nah caihakecime namedung pedwa ga ntum bam. Pa pe kilabe dage rang, “Li kedi de mi gage kaigai nah taktyei langgailo caihakecime namedung ziemne.” <verse eid="2KI 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 4:39" />Hangge pau luh ga mie giniadung peei hekwa kera. Pa renaam kubetsi ngaulu nah pe pai tei puilu kera kieege renaam kubetsi de rai hekwalu. Penui cidungde pang takcai lwe gi gage kai gailu, dede cidungde daipai kenzwabe bi kecu cima. <verse eid="2KI 4:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 4:40" />Cine penui taktyei de ruigai beu minadung de peu tyei kera. Pecai, penui tyei kebam dau, penui sahgai nah rang, “Tinggwang Minabe, li ga au ketsai bam lie!” Cine penui cide tyei si gai lakdi. <verse eid="2KI 4:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 4:41" />Dede Elisha rang, “Tokkui kesa pwagwang.” Pa cide li gage kelien gai nah rang, “Minadung de cide ruigai beu, iciu eh penui tyeilu kerane.” Pecai li ga magede mide teimsiadi kera bam tadi.<verse eid="2KI 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mina hai ge matyei kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="2KI 4:42" />Mipei ge Baal Shalishah gade Tinggwang minabe da gwang nah luhlüt raitu kelu gade barley tangku kwak ngkai pe loko ga punggwang beu, nah teipuidung riau nnwa kelube. Elisha rang, “Aide mina dungde ha beudi ciu eh penui tyeilu kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 4:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="2KI 4:43" />Pe kilabe rang, “Ih aide minadung haige dwa gage kaibeu zie deni?” Dede Elisha rangdi, “Aide mina dungde peulo, iciu eh penui tyeilu kerane, kedanemene RAMPAUBE ranggai, ‘Penui tyei luzie nah kesa tyeibang luzie’” <verse eid="2KI 4:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="2KI 4:44" />Cine pe kilabe penui dwa gage taktyei kaibeu; penui tyeilu, nah kesa tyeibanglu, RAMPAUBE sampet kai kebeu sam de siakte.<verse eid="2KI 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="2KI 5" />
  <para style="s">Naaman kempa teimmi kelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 5:1" />Cu Naaman, Aram ga hegwangpei gu reugwa muibe, pe gwangpei miakngau gade mina kenlang nah kerütpeulu kebui ge, kedanemene pe dade RAMPAUBE Aram leuhme de ngkieng kelu kepeune. Pa au ngkieng nah kuusüt me ge, dede kempa mateei peda bam. <verse eid="2KI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 5:2" />Aram ga reugwamedung Israelme deu gade mbai mie regi nah mipui nage de ngngwa lu. Pa Naaman nau kilapui teidi. <verse eid="2KI 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 5:3" />Cipau puina de pe mpaupui dage rangdi, “Ih a mpaube de Samaria ga lungh kebam caihakecibe da mie neu da! Ciciucai pa a mpaube pe kempa mateei de tei ngkei lubui.” <verse eid="2KI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 5:4" />Cine Naaman mie nah hegwangpei de Israel gade ngngwa gwang lwe kebam releipuina dai rang bi paubeu. <verse eid="2KI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 5:5" />Cine Aram gwangpei rangdi, “Cu miecu, nah Ih Israel gwangpei de laisiu ge langgai beuzie.” Naaman tetdi nah peda rangkanggeu talent kerei, kecak cang herok, nah paiheni kereleu kerei ge keulu. <verse eid="2KI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 5:6" />Pa laisiu de Israel gwangpei da pwa mie kela de ainzwa rau nzeu, “Cu laisiu aide n taiga keugwang kecudau, Ih n dage Naaman a kilabe de langgai kecu nang ngau zie, ciciulude nang peda pe kempa mateei tei ngkeilu kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 5:7" />Israel gwangpei laisiu de pei keludau, pa pe paiheni teuhak eh rangdi, “Ih Tinggwang ni, teitset nah tei nring lu kera, mina aide acu peu pe mateei mpa kecu pei de tei ngkeilu neu lani? Dede cu cilu, pa acu ngngwa kesamlim lai eh kela peeila dida.”<verse eid="2KI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 5:8" />Cine Elisha Tinggwang minabe Israel gwangpei pe paiheni teuhak kecu siulu ge, pa hegwangpei de sam langgai, “Nang daitei n niadung teihak bam no? Pecu peu cu a da gwanglo, nah Israel ga caihakecime bam kecu pa ci luzie.” <verse eid="2KI 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 5:9" />Cine Naaman pe hekündung nah pe bagidung teu lwe Elisha ki kikam ga gwang saplu. <verse eid="2KI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 5:10" />Elisha pe dage samgwa ge de sam langgai, rang eh, “Mie delwe Jordan reuki gade nkatei ncu pia hena huidi, nah n pumteih nu nzwa yi dizie; nang mci dizie.” <verse eid="2KI 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 5:11" />Dede Naaman perata di eh tetdi delwe rangdi, “Pielo, Ih cet kecu pa ada kisie mpet bi zie delwe saplu nah RAMPAUBE pe Tinggwang zi de qu kera, nah pejam gadung peba le kemui gwang nah a mateei mpa kecude tei ngkei beu. <verse eid="2KI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 5:12" />Damascus ga kebam reukidung, Abanah penai Pharpar, Israelme gu dui leune swade yiki meni? Ih cikade acu duipialwe mci gailak ni?” Cine pa nreucaili nah pe ratasüt eh tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 5:13" />Pecai Naaman kilame gwang nna eh pe dage ranggai, “A pei, magade caihakecibe ncu tei kepa ge tei lulo aja kaibeu cai, nang tei mene tadi zieni? Iciucai, pa ncu, ‘Nkatei ncu dui gage mpunglu eh mcilu?’” decai nang tei mene tadi zieni? <verse eid="2KI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 5:14" />Pecai pa Jordan reuki ga nghung eh Tinggwang minabe ne rang kebeudung de mzai eh, pia hena pecu mpunglu. Pe pumteih hena keceuna pumteih ge nzwa yicangsiak dailu, nah pa yilu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 4:27">Luk. 4:27</ref></char></note><verse eid="2KI 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 5:15" />Naaman Tinggwang minabe da cailigwang, pa nah pe caisuime pelane, gwang eh pe dwaga saplu. Pa rangdi, “Pielo, cu Ih cilu da Israel ga gwale kideu pelane ga Tinggwang bam kemak. Cide ziemne, kehereide n kilabe dade mapeu ge keu lulo.” <verse eid="2KI 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 5:16" />Dede Elisha keli eh, “Ring kela RAMPAUBE nzwa, pedwa ga Ih sap, Ih magede keu lak.” Naaman Elisha de mapeuge keu lulo ketangbi, dede pa mlaidi. <verse eid="2KI 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 5:17" />Cine Naaman rangdi, “Cinzwa meliecai, ge peu Ih ncu tangdei gada püt kena n kilabe de peulo kiela, kedanemene cu gade, n kilabe ratak mede keru reca teipwa RAMPAUBE de gwale hera kedade tei beulak delu. <verse eid="2KI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 5:18" />Aipau kiede ziemne RAMPAUBE n kilabe de mmaudi kelakne, cide cai, a hegwangpei Rimmon recaki ga mie eh reca kecudau, nah pa a ba ga ngngei nah Ih de Rimmon recaki gade keumie eh, Ih akatei Rimmon recaki ga keumie kecudau, aipau kie gade RAMPAUBE de peu n kilabe mau gi beulo.” <verse eid="2KI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 5:19" />Elisha pe dage rangdi, “Lungciepbe bam eh tetcu.” Cine Naaman tetdi.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 5:34">Mrk. 5:34</ref></char></note><verse eid="2KI 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 5:20" />Pa tet ndei kemak dau ge, Elisha kilabe Gehazi Tinggwang minabe pekatei pecu resiu kecudau, “Pielo, a mpaube Aramme pei Naaman de ngga beu eh pa pe ba gade mapeu pwa gwang kelade keu ta dida. Ring kela RAMPAUBE nzwa, Ih pecai pak mie eh pe dade mage au keu luzie.” <verse eid="2KI 5:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 5:21" />Cine Gehazi Naaman caisui mie. Naaman mige pecai pak gwangla eh ngau kecudau, pa pecu dau kerane pe bagi gade nsau nghunglu eh rangdi, “Ma pelane petaubam ha?” <verse eid="2KI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 5:22" />Gehazi rangdi, “Ma pelane petaubam lie. A mpaube ne acu langgai, rang eh, ‘Pielo, cu Ephraim lamlwatu deudi gade caihakecimedung maa mi hangna a da gwang bam. Kehereide rangkanggeu talent ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:22 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu kilogram 34 ge.</char></note> nah paiheni kereleu kena penai de ha gai beulo.’” <verse eid="2KI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 5:23" />Naaman keli eh, “Ih rangkanggeu talent kena ncu a sui keyi gade peu neu bam lie.” Naaman Gehazi de ketangbi di nah loko kena gage rangkanggeu talent kena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:23 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu kilogram 68 ge.</char></note>, paiheni kereleu kena le kang gaibeu, nah cidung pe kilabe hangna de pwapeu eh rangkanggeu nsung kena de Gehazi dwa pwa rai tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 5:24" />Gehazi lamlwatu ga gwang kecudau, pa rangkanggeu nsung penai ba gade pwalu nah heki gage cidungde keu kebai di; pa kila kena de lang gidi, nah penai tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 5:25" />Gehazi kilung ga nlüt eh pe mpaube dwa saplu kecudau, Elisha pe dage rangdi, “Nang daiga de gwang lano, Gehazi?” Pa keli eh, “N kilabe mage gade mie ma.” <verse eid="2KI 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 5:26" />Elisha Gehazi dage rangdi, “Minabe pe bagi gade mpet eh ncu redau kecudau a rabe nda la meni? Cu rangkang nah paiheni, olive bwa nah kubetsi, meurünna nah ketumseu, nah kilame mipeina nah kilame mipuina luu kera ting ni? <verse eid="2KI 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 5:27" />Cine Naaman kempa mateei de nda nah n leuhme da kelungta la dizie.” Cine Gehazi pedwa gade tetdi, mateei cide ne buising nzwa hadi.<verse eid="2KI 5:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="2KI 6" />
  <para style="s">Nreumui duireu kenghang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 6:1" />Caihakecibe napeimedung Elisha dage rangdi, “Anui ncu ngngwa lungh kebam heni de anui pelane ziemne ceu ham lie. <verse eid="2KI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 6:2" />Ngau nggia eh peu anuide Jordan ga mielo, nah cika mileune de tsingbang bilu delwe anui heni cika lungh kera ki tei lugo.” Elisha keligai, “Nnui mie cu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 6:3" />Penui kakga hangge rangdi, “Ngaunggia eh n kilame de nzangmie beulo.” Elisha keligai. “Ih miezie.” <verse eid="2KI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 6:4" />Cine pa penuide nzang mielu, nah penui Jordan ga gwang luge, penui tsingbangdung bi ngkau cudi. <verse eid="2KI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 6:5" />Dede bi bam kecudau hangge gu nreu peu dui ga cakmie dige; pa sah cudi delwe rangdi, “Oh, a mpaubo, cide au releukelu nreu lie!” <verse eid="2KI 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 6:6" />Cine Tinggwang minabe rangdi, “Daiga cakmie dino?” Minabe Elisha de pebam saulia beu. Pecai pa tsingtie ge danglu, delwe dui gage keliengai nah hegeu de nlim peu cuhdi. <verse eid="2KI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 6:7" />Elisha rangdi, “Keu ncuh lu” Cine minabe peba ketwamie delwe cide keulu.<verse eid="2KI 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Elisha ne Aramme miakcietme de keukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 6:8" />Cu Aramme gwangpei Israelme de ngngwa hereu tei bamla. Pa pe kilame de kelunglia delwe, ranggai, “A ramzeuki heni cikenzwa gega tei kera cetlu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 6:9" />Cine Tinggwang minabe Israelme gwangpei dage langgai, “Cipau bam mide au tet kah sia bi de lie, kedanemene Aramme cika nghung laulu debeu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 6:10" />Israelme gwangpei Tinggwang minabe pecu mrai rang mriak kegai ni de gage sam langgai. Hegwangpei cika piana cum swade kiee eh kemie dau, pa mriak delwe mie. <verse eid="2KI 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 6:11" />Aramme gwangpei sam aidungde ci nswa kelu ci luge perata sütdi delwe pa pe kilame de qulu delwe penui dage rangdi, “Nnui a dage ranglia lak ni caube anui kakga Israelme gwangpei, lambi?” <verse eid="2KI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 6:12" />Cine pe kilame hangge rangdi, “Melie, a mpaubo, hegwangpei, dede Israel ga caihakecibe Elisha Israelme gwangpei dage nang nzeubung gade kerang samdung pau beu bamlie.” <verse eid="2KI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 6:13" />Hegwangpei keligai, “Mie delwe Elisha daiga bam bi pielo, iciude Ih mina de langpwa pecu tuilu kerane.” Iciu ge pe dage, “Ainie, pa au Dothan ga bamlie,” de eh rangbeu.<verse eid="2KI 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 6:14" />Cine hegwangpei Dothan gage hekündung, bagidung, nah reugwame kekiee langgai. Penui tingmui dau gwang canglu delwe namdi de twagwalu. <verse eid="2KI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 6:15" />Pecai Tinggwang kilabe minabe cuh zilu delwe hegwale mie ge, ainie, reugwame kekiee ge hekündung nah bagidung teulwe namdi twagwa pwa bamdi. Pe kilabe pe dage rangdi, “Oh, a mpaubo! Anui dai nzwa lai?” <verse eid="2KI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 6:16" />Elisha sam keligai, “Hingso, kedanemene anuide ngngwa kebamme au penuide ngngwa kelame swade kieeki lu.” <verse eid="2KI 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 6:17" />Elisha kekie tei eh rangdi, “RAMPAUBO, nang pemiak tei mrak beulo Ih kiela iciu eh pa ma ngaulu kerane.” Pecai RAMPAUBE kilabe miak tei mrak gaibeu ge pa mangaulu. Ainie, lamlwatu ga hekwendung nah bagidung ne puiting de Elisha taiga twagwa pung kebam ngaulu. <verse eid="2KI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 6:18" />Pecai Arameanme pe da nghung keladau Elisha kekie tei eh RAMPAUBE dage rangdi, “Mina aidung miak teiciet dilo, Ih n dage kiela.” Cine RAMPAUBE penui miak teicietdi, Elisha kie kegai nzwa. <verse eid="2KI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 6:19" />Pecai Elisha Aramme dage rangbeu, “Aide lampui ma, mede aide namdi de ma. Acai suilu sangne, Ih nnui pei kelabe pei da nnuide nzang gwang beu zie” de beu. Pecai pa penuide Samaria ga nzang gwangdi.<verse eid="2KI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 6:20" />Cidau penui Samaria ga gwanglu ge, Elisha rangdi, “RAMPAUBO, mina aidung miak tei mrak beulo iciu eh peu penuide mangaulu kerane.” RAMPAUBE penui miak ngkei gai beu nah penui mangaulu, nah ainie, penui au Samaria namdi sumga gwang bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 6:21" />Israel gwangpei pa penuide ngau kegai dau Elisha dage rangdi, “Apei, Ih penuide teitset dizie mi? Ih penuide teitset dizie mi?” <verse eid="2KI 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 6:22" />Elisha keligai, “Nang penuide teitset sia bi da, nang n kiengtie nah n lakpi le tui kelumedung de nang teitset zie ni? Tangku nah dui penui dwaga ge dung gai beulo, iciu de peu penuide sak nah tyeilu kera, delwe penui mpaube da gwangdi lulo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 6:23" />Cine hegwangpei penui ziemne taktyei kekiee ge mteilu, penui tyei nah sak cang luge, pa penuide lang gidi, nah penui mpaupei da penui cailigwangdi. Aramme reugwa aipau maade peting ketiege Israelme deu ga gwang dai tadi.<verse eid="2KI 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria Gwakelu ga Herakum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 6:24" />Pecai matie mene Aramme hegwangpei Ben Hadad pe reugwame pelane de quhekwalu delwe Samaria de gwaketang eh cide tuilu. <verse eid="2KI 6:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 6:25" />Cine Samaria ga herakum kumdi gwangdi. Ainie, penui cide tui pwa bamdi, cika gada peu rangkang geu riakheset, nah tamhau teu rangkang geu mengei le zwa cu kecang. <verse eid="2KI 6:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 6:26" />Israel hegwangpei kirie taiga tetkah gwang keladau, mipui ge pe dage sahgai, “A mpaubo, hegwangpei, acu ngha lo.” <verse eid="2KI 6:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 6:27" />Pa rangdi, “Magade RAMPAUBE ncu ngha beu melie cai, Ih dainzwa ncu nghalu laino? Hecaipung gade mede zauniakbam gade madung ge de mpet me deni?” <verse eid="2KI 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 6:28" />Hegwangpei rang jüja eh, “Ncu dai ne tei keherei au no?” Pa keligai, “Aipau puide a dage rangdi, ‘N napei de halo iciu de henai anui pecu lang tyeilu kerane, nah anui ncünne a napei de tyei dailu kera.’” <verse eid="2KI 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 6:29" />Cine anui a napei de swalu delwe pecu tyeilu, nah pecai benai Ih pe dage rangdi, “N napei de halo anai iciu eh anui pecu lang tyei kerane, dede pa au pe napei de hebai di dilie”. <verse eid="2KI 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 6:30" />Cine hegwangpei mipui samdung siu kegaidau, pa pepaidung hietdi (cu pa kirie ga tet kah gwangla) nah minadung pie gaige pa au roso pai petei tung eh balwe bam kecu ngau. <verse eid="2KI 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 6:31" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Magade henai Shaphat napei Elisha peu danglu mecai, Tinggwang de peu acu tei keherei liagai kelak peu tei kelube teilo.”<verse eid="2KI 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 6:32" />Dede Elisha au peki ga ntum bam, nah hangkiamedung de pecu ngngwa ntum bam. Hegwangpei pe taiga kebam mipei gede langgai, dede samgwabe Elisha da gwang kecudau, pa hangkiame dage rangdi, “Pielo aipau de mide teiketsetme napeide dainzwa apeu dang teu tet kera langgai zeubi, Pielo, samgwame gwang sangne, kikam ngkuidi, nah kikam ngkui gimlu pecu peu lüt so. Pe mpaube pi kwa pecai la meni?” <verse eid="2KI 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 6:33" />Pa penuide marang kebam dau, ainie, samgwabe pe taiga gwang canglu. Hegwangpei ainzwa rang lie, “Ainie, keherei aide RAMPAUBE dade gwang lie. Daitei Ih RAMPAUBE de kwabam si lai no?”<verse eid="2KI 6:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="2KI 7" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 7:1" />Elisha rangdi, “RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo. Ainzwa RAMPAUBE rangla: ‘Ncünne aikenzwa tingdau Samaria rieki gade tokkui mdet ge<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram kecum kenzwa ge</char></note>, shekel ket le, nah barley mdet kena<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:1 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">kilogram herok kenzwa ge</char></note> shekel ket le zwa beuzie.’” <verse eid="2KI 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 7:2" />Pecai hegwangpei kedibe ba bagie teu kelabe de Tinggwang minabe sam keligai, “Pielo, magade RAMPAUBE tinggim gade kebaki teigai liede, aikenzwa ge tei lubui ni?” Elisha keligai, “Pielo, nang cide tei kedi n miak le ngau zie dede, nang cidung ketde tyei lak.”<verse eid="2KI 7:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Reugwade Mtakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 7:3" />Cipau tingdau namdi rieki gwale mipei hang mdai kempa mateei bam la. Penui hangge hangge de rangdi, “Anui aika daitei tsai kemaktane bam lai no? <verse eid="2KI 7:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 7:4" />Magade anui namdi ga nlüt zielie de anui rang cai, ciucai namdi ga herakum kum bam nah anui cikade tsai dizie. Dede magade anui aika bam liede anui tsai dizie. Cine, gwanglo, anui Aramme reugwame taiga mie cugo. Magade penui anuide nzang bam beuzie liecai, anui ring luzie, nah penui anuide teitset dicai, anui tsai dizie.” <verse eid="2KI 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 7:5" />Cine penui mui rim mie kecudau cuh eh Aramme ramzeuki gage tetgai, penui tet gwang ramzeuki ga mie canglu ge, migede cika bam ma. <verse eid="2KI 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 7:6" />Kedanemene Rampaube ne teipwa Aram reugwame de peu hekwendung kwa nah bagidung kwa de nah reugwame kieesüt eh gwangkela kwa peu siu gaige penui hangge hangge dade rangdi, “Israelme hegwangpei au Hittitme gwangpeidung nah Egyptmedung de li pwa anuide gwaketang kera gwang.” <verse eid="2KI 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 7:7" />Cine reugwamedung cuhlwe mui rim kecudau pakdi; penui penui paikidung, penui hekündung nah penui gadadung nah ramzeuki pelui pela kai pütdi delwe penui kering ria ziemne pakdi. <verse eid="2KI 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 7:8" />Mpa kelamedung ramzeuki tu lebie gwang cang luge, penui paiki ge ga lütlu delwe penui tyei nah saklu nah rangkanggeu penai kecak nah paidung pwa mie eh cidungde kebailu. Penui cailigwang dai lwe paiki keda ga lütlu delwe cikade mah kebamdung kecung dailu delwe keu mie eh cide kebailu.<verse eid="2KI 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 7:9" />Pecai penui hangge dage rangdi, “Anui petaube tei meda. Henai samlia keyi benai tingba da, dede anui cipaude zingde bam dida. Magade anui ting keba kemaktane kwa cai, anuide saja peubi zieda. Ciciucai cu, gwanglu, anui tet pwa hegwangpei kilungme dage paubeu go.” <verse eid="2KI 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 7:10" />Cine penui mie delwe namdi rieki kwa kebamme de qugai. Penui penuide mpau eh, ranggai, “Anui Aramme ramzeuki ga mie, dede cika migede gah, makwa gede siu ma, dede hekündung de keupwa bam nah gada dungde keu pwabam, nah paiki dungde deuli mene bamlie.” <verse eid="2KI 7:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 7:11" />Pecai rieki kekwamedung samlia keyi de sah gai, nah pecai pelung lebie hegwangpei kilungme dage pau cangbeu. <verse eid="2KI 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 7:12" />Pecai hegwangpei tingmui cuhlu delwe pe kilamedung dade rangdi, “Cu Ih nnui dage Arammedung anui dage dai teigai bi ranglia zie. Anui mzeu bam kecu penui cibam, cine penui ramzeuki pütdi delwe luhdung ga penuikatei mbai bam dida. Penui rang kecu, ‘Penui namdi gade mpet sangne, anui penuide ring eh tuilu zie delwe penuide namdi ga lüt luzie.’” <verse eid="2KI 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 7:13" />Hegwangpei kilame hangge sam keli eh rangdi, “Ih nda kiela, mipei kangge depeu hekwen mengei namdi ga bang bamkecu dungde keulu. Penui au Israelme nalung dung bang kebam nzwada, kekiee lebie tsai dida, nah aidungde anui pie kera langgai go.” <verse eid="2KI 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 7:14" />Cine penui bagi kena nah hekwen de si delwe keulu, delwe hegwangpei penuide Aramme reugwame cai langgai eh penui ranggai, “Mie delwe pielo.” <verse eid="2KI 7:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 7:15" />Penui Jordan ga penui cai mie, nah lampuidung ga Aramme kelwa delwe pak kecune penui paidung nah reunetdung zang pui pwa bam. Cine samgwamedung cailigwang delwe hegwangpei dage pau liabeu.<verse eid="2KI 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 7:16" />Iciuge minadung Aramme ramzeuki ga mie eh kecunglu. RAMPAUBE sam rang kecu nzwa delwe tokkui keyibe mdet ge shekel ket le nah barley mdet kena, shekel ket le zwa kecu teidi. <verse eid="2KI 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 7:17" />Hegwangpei kedibe ba pa ngngei kebambe de peu Herieki kekwabe tei kera sam kaigai, ge minadung herieki lampui gade pecu cai ngkaudi. Tinggwang minabe hegwangpei da gwang eh rang kegai nzwa pa tsaidi. <verse eid="2KI 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 7:18" />Cine cide Tinggwang minabe hegwangpei dage rang kebeu nzwa, ranggai, “Cipau tingdau Samaria rieki ga pemdet kena barley, shekel ket le ngau lu zie nah shekel ket le tangku tok pemdet ge, de kecu nzwa teicang gwanglu.” <verse eid="2KI 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 7:19" />Cipau kedihbe Tinggwang mina sam keli eh rangdi, “Pielo, RAMPAUBE ne tinggim ga hebakidung tei gai lie de, ma aidungde tei lubui ni?” Elisha rang dai eh cu, “Pie lulo, n miak dwa gade tei gwang kecu nang ngau zie, dede nang cidung de kette tyei lak.” <verse eid="2KI 7:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 7:20" />Cinzwa gapte peda tei cang di delie, kedanemene rieki gade minadung ne pecu nia di eh, pa tsaidi.<verse eid="2KI 7:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="2KI 8" />
  <para style="s">Shunamme Deu Ngamdaikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 8:1" />Cu Elisha mipui, pa pe napei de tei mring dai kelube pui dage marang eh pa rangdi, “cuhlu, delwe n kilungme de ngngwalwe tet culo, nah hangdeu keda ga nang bamlu kebui ga bam lulo, kedanemene RAMPAUBE aipau deu de gage mmi hena ge herakum kum gwang kera kaidi zie delie.” <verse eid="2KI 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 8:2" />Cine mipuibe cuhlu delwe pa Tinggwang minabe kerang de mzailu, pa pe kilungme de nzanglu delwe mie Philistinme deu ga mmi hena lungh ladi. <verse eid="2KI 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 8:3" />Cidau mmi hena cangdi ge mipuibe Philistinme deu gade cailigwang dailu nah pa hegwangpei da mie peki nah pedeu peulo peda pe nggia kiedi. <verse eid="2KI 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 8:4" />Hegwangpei au cu Tinggwang minabe kila Gehazi de ngngwa resiu bam eh ranggai, “Kehereide Elisha ma keditei kegai pelane a dage ranglo.” <verse eid="2KI 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 8:5" />Pecai pa hegwangpei dage Elisha ne dai nzwa delwe tsaikedi henanabe de tei mringlu di bi ranglia kebam dau, pe napei de tei mring kebeube pui de gwang hegwangpei dade peki nah pedeu halo pe nggia kie kera gwanglu. Gehazi rangdi, “Hegwangpei, a mpaubo, Elisha ne tei mring dai kebeube de aipau puide de lie nah aide pe napei de lie.” <verse eid="2KI 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 8:6" />Hegwangpei mipuibe dade pe napei ha keteu gaige, pa pe dage cide rang siak de lia bam. Cine hegwangpei kedime ge de mipuibe de ngha kerane sam kaigai eh ranggai, “Pecu pegu leune nah pa tetdi kecu benai gade henai kecang pe luhdung gade luhlüt kelu pelane peu dai beudi lulo.”<verse eid="2KI 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hazael ne Ben-Hadad de Daptset kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 8:7" />Elisha Aram gwangpei Ben Hadad teeinei eh kebam Damascus ga gwanglu. Hegwangpei dage rangbeu di, “Tinggwang minabe aika gwang bamlie.” <verse eid="2KI 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 8:8" />Hegwangpei Hazael dage rangdi, “N ba ga mapeudung ge keulu delwe Tinggwang minabe de mie redau lo, nah pecu peu RAMPAUBE dade keteu gailo ‘Ih aipau mateei de gade yi dailu zie ni?’” <verse eid="2KI 8:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 8:9" />Cine Hazeal pecu redau kerane Damascus ga mapeu keyi leune ketsamtsam, utdung riakdai ne punglwe mie. Cine Hazael gwang Elisha dwaga saplu delwe rangdi, “N napei Aram gwangpei Ben Hadad acu n dage langgai beu, ranggai, ‘Ih a mateei aide gade yi dailu zie mi?’” <verse eid="2KI 8:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 8:10" />Elisha pe dage rangdi, “Mie, Ben Hadad dage rangbeulo, ‘Nang yi dai bi luzie,’ dede RAMPAUBE acu pwa lia kecu pa au tsaidi bi zie lie.” <verse eid="2KI 8:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 8:11" />Pecai Elisha Hazael de pieling ci gai pa ngamdi kemaktane, nah Tinggwang minabe hapdi. <verse eid="2KI 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 8:12" />Hazael, “A mpaubo, nang daitei eh hap zeu no?” Pa keligai, “Kedanemene nang Israelme minadung dage makesia teigai zie kecu Ih ci. Nang penui renei kwakeludung mi le rudi zie nah nang penui rehangmedungde kiengtie le teitset dizie, penui hena keceu nadungde de kedeu tset, nah penui tetlak kela puidung de riempopdi zielu.” <verse eid="2KI 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 8:13" />Hazael keligai, “N kilabe cau no, pa ma kedi aikenzwa tei kera? Pa au heteu ge gwale ma.” Elisha keligai, “RAMPAUBE nang Aram reu hegwang tei zielie kecu acu keulia da.” <verse eid="2KI 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 8:14" />Hazael pecai Elisha da de tet pwa pe mpaube da gwang dai luge hegwangpei pe dade rangdi, “Elisha n dage dai lie rang no?” Pa keligai, “Pa a dade rang kecu nang yibi luzie lie au lie.” <verse eid="2KI 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 8:15" />Pecai Hazael pecai benai paikui keulu eh cide dui gage mpunglu delwe Ben Hadad zu gage bah gaibeu iciu eh pa tsaidi. Pecai Hazael pebam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Jehoram</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 8:16" />Ahab napei, Joram Israel ga hegwang tei kelu mmi mengei bekum Jehoram hegwang teilu. Pa au Judah gwangpei Jehoshaphat napei. Pa Jehoshaphat Judahme ga hegwang ketei dau hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 8:17" />Jehoram mmi camreiekena dau pa hegwang teilu, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi heset ge hegwang teigwang. <verse eid="2KI 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 8:18" />Jehoram Israel ga hegwangmedung puisaudung de nzuidi, Ahab kelak keteidung de nzwa eh, kedanemene pa Ahab napui de penau kelune, nah pa RAMPAUBE dwaga de kemau teigai kedine. <verse eid="2KI 8:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 8:19" />Cinzwa liede, RAMPAUBE au pe kilabe David ziemne Judah de tei ngkapdi neu ma, kedanemene pa pedage peleuhme pecu peu mui zielie rang pwa kebam ziemne.<verse eid="2KI 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 8:20" />Jehoram hegwang ketei tingdau, Edomme Judahme kang gade ngngwa siadi, delwe penui hegwangpei ge penui reu di kera ncuhlu. <verse eid="2KI 8:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 8:21" />Pecai Jehoram pegu bagidung pelane keu lwe Zair ga kah gwanglu. Edomme ne Jehoram de twagwalu ge, pe bagi reugwame muibe cuhlwe penuide tingmui gage gwa ketang; dede Jehoram reugwamedung pakdi nah penui kidung ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="2KI 8:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 8:22" />Cine henai kecang de Edomme Judahme de ngngwa sia bam cang. Cipau ting dau Libnah de penuide ngngwa siadi. <verse eid="2KI 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 8:23" />Jehoram tei kegwang kedadung, pa tei kegai pelane, Judahme gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwa bam meni? <verse eid="2KI 8:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 8:24" />Jehoram pe peime nzwa tsaidi nah penuide ngngwa David namdi ga kungdi. Pecai pe napei Ahaziah ne pebam leu lwe hegwangpei teilu.<verse eid="2KI 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Ahaziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 8:25" />Israel gwangpei Ahab napei Joram hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiekena bekum, Judah gwangpei Jehoram napei Ahaziah hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 8:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 8:26" />Ahaziah mmi ngkaiekena dau pa hegwang tei cudi, pa Jerusalem ga mmi ge hegwang tei gwang. Pepui zi cai Athaliah; pa au Israelme hegwangpei Omri napui. <verse eid="2KI 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 8:27" />Ahaziah Ahab kelak puisaudung de nzuidi; Ahab kelak tei kedi nzwa, pa RAMPAUBE dwade kemau teidi, kedanemene Ahaziah nautak ketei gade Ahab kibaume kecune. <verse eid="2KI 8:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 8:28" />Ahaziah Aram gwangpei Hazael de Ramoth Gilead gade regi kerane Ahab napei Joram de ngngwa lwe mie. Aramme ne Joram de tei rezamdi. <verse eid="2KI 8:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 8:29" />Hegwangpei Joram Ramah gade Aram gwangpei Hazael de ngngwa regi kecudau Aramme ne pecu tei rezam kedide yi dailu kerane Jezreel ga cailigwangdi. Cine Judah gwangpei Jehoram napei Ahaziah, Ahab napei Joram de pie kerane Jezreel ga nghungdi, kedanemene Joram de rezam kedine.<verse eid="2KI 8:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="2KI 9" />
  <para style="s">Jehu de Israel Gwangpei Keniakkelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 9:1" />Caihakecibe Elisha caihakecime maa gade hangge de qulu eh pe dage rangdi, “Hebeuh tei kerane mteilu, pecai maca bung keceu aide n ba gage pwalu nah Ramoth Gilead ga miecu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:1 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 12:35">Luk. 12:35</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 9:2" />Nang miecanglu kecudau, Nimshi capei Jehoshaphat napei Jehu de pielu, nah lwetlu nah pe zangme kakga de pecu teu cuhlu, nah pecu kibung pelung lambie ngngwa nlütlu. <verse eid="2KI 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 9:3" />Pecai maca bung de keulu delwe pepeu gage rui gai eh rang, ‘RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai: “Ih ncu Israel reu hegwangpei keniak gaibeu da.”’ Pecai kikam ngkeilu, delwe pak tetdi; nneu diso.” <verse eid="2KI 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 9:4" />Cine caihakeci rehangbe, Ramoth Gilead ga miedi. <verse eid="2KI 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 9:5" />Pa miecang keludau, ainie, reugwame reu kedimedung ntum bam. Cine caihakeci rehangbe rangdi, “Kedibo, Ih nda sam teugwang lalie.” Jehu keli eh, “Anui cau be ziemne no?” Caihakeci rehangbe keli eh, “Kedibo, n ziemne.” <verse eid="2KI 9:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 9:6" />Cine Jehu cuhlu nah kilung ga nlwetti, nah caihakecibe pepeu gage macadui rui gai nah Jehu dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa ranggai: ‘RAMPAUBE minadung reu, Israelme reu, Ih ncu hegwangpei keniak luda. <verse eid="2KI 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 9:7" />Nang n mpaube Ahab kilungme de teitset maisia, ciciulude Ih a kila caihakecimedung jai, nah RAMPAUBE kilame pelane pejai zau kegai, Jezebel ba gade daptset kedimedung de saja peulu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 9:8" />Ahab kilungme pelane de teingkap dizie, nah Ahab leuhme gade mipeina pelane de teitset dizie, pa hebaang tei mede tei kemakme liede. <verse eid="2KI 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 9:9" />Ih Ahab ki de Nebat napei Jeroboam ki nzwa nah Ahijah napei Baasha ki nzwa tei dizie. <verse eid="2KI 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 9:10" />Jezebel de Jezreel gade peu heteudung ne tyei luzie, nah migede pepau teukung ra bam lak.’” Pecai caihakecibe kikam ngkei lwe pak tetdi.<verse eid="2KI 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 9:11" />Pecai Jehu pe mpaube kilame da mpet, nah hangge pecu rangdi, “Maleune petau bam ha? Daitei kemie pei aide nda gwang lano?” Jehu penuide keli eh, “Nnui mina cide de cibam, nah pa rang kegaidung de.” <verse eid="2KI 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 9:12" />Penui rangdi, “Cide au kenret lie. Anuide ranglia lo.” Jehu keli eh, “Pa acu ainzwalie cinzwalie rang, nah pa de rangdi, ‘RAMPAUBE ainzwa ranggai: Ih ncu Israelme reu hegwang tei kera keniak luda.’” <verse eid="2KI 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 9:13" />Ge penui hangge ge pe hegwa pai lwak mpet zettelwe Jehu kang takswa nreutu gage kamlu. Penui telui kwa gai nah rangdi, “Jehu au hegwangpei.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">9:13 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LUK 19:36">Luk. 19:36</ref></char></note><verse eid="2KI 9:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehu ne Joram penai Ahaziah de Teitset Kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 9:14" />Aipau ria gade Nimshi capei Jehoshaphat napei Jehu heciem tei delwe Joram de renia di. Cu Joram Ramoth Gilead deu de gumpung eh bam di, pa nah Israelme pelane, Aram gwangpei Hazael ziemne, <verse eid="2KI 9:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 9:15" />dede Hegwangpei Joram, Jezreel ga caili gwangdi pa Aram gwangpei Hazael de ngngwa regi kecudau, Aramme ne pecu tei rejam kedidung de tei hemilu kerane.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2KI 9:15">Jehu Joram kilamedung de rangdi, “Magade aide n kecet de lie cai, peu mide pak tet so nah namdi gade peu tet diso, iciu eh Jezreel ga mie sambe paulu kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 9:16" />Cine Jehu bagi gade Jezreel gage tet kaidi; Joram cika mtak kebam ne. Cu Judahme gwangpei Ahaziah Joram de pie kerane gwangla.<verse eid="2KI 9:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 9:17" />Jezreel nam kekwabepei renei ga sap eh bam, nah pa kendei gade gwang keladau pa Jehu caisuimedung ge de ngau eh; pa rangdi, “Mina hemaa ge gwang kela Ih ngau lie.” Joram rang eh, “Hekwenketeube de ngngwa lwe penuide redau kerane pecu langgai beulo; pecu ainzwa ranglo beu, ‘Nnui kezuyi teu gwangla ni?’” <verse eid="2KI 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 9:18" />Cine hekwenketeube pei de langgai pecu dau kerane; pa rangdi, “Hegwangpei ainzwa rang lie: ‘Nnui kezuyi teu gwangla ni?’” Cine Jehu rang eh, “Nang kezuyi de le dai teira? Caisim lwe a caisui lu.” Pecai kekwabepei hegwangpei de pau liabeu, “Samgwabe penuide dau da, dede pa au cailigwang dai meda.” <verse eid="2KI 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 9:19" />Pecai pa hekwenketeume pekena be de langgai eh, penuida gwang kela rangdi, “Hegwangpei ainzwa ranglie: ‘Nnui kezuyi teu gwang lani?’” Jehu keli gai, “Nang kezuyi de le dai teira? Caisim lwe a caisuilu.” <verse eid="2KI 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 9:20" />Pecaide kekwabepei paulia dai, “Pa penuide dau da, dede pa au cailigwang dai meda. Bagi teula cu rehi de au Nimshi napei Jehu teu cu nzwa lie; pa gwa süt eh teula.”<verse eid="2KI 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 9:21" />Cine Joram rangdi, “A bagi mtei gai lulo.” Penui pe bagi mteilu, nah Israel gwangpei Joram nah Judah gwangpei Ahaziah tet petdi, pe bagi riep gade, Jehu de dau kerane. Penai pecu Jezreelme Naboth deu gade ngaulu. <verse eid="2KI 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 9:22" />Joram Jehu de ngau kecudau, pa rangdi, “Jehu, nang kezuyi teu gwang lani?” Pa keli eh, “Dai kezuyige bamno, mamie kereca nah herakesia bata ketei n pui Jezebel da kieesüt eh bam kecudau?” <verse eid="2KI 9:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 9:23" />Cine Joram pe bagi kereu lwe tetdi nah Ahaziah dage rangdi, “Ahaziah, cika au masangkemak bam.” <verse eid="2KI 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 9:24" />Pecai Jehu pe kengkieng pelane teu pe lakpi pwa galu nah pe keutu kena kakga Joram de kap gai eh; lakpitsi de pe mlung reudi, nah pa pe bagi ga kau miedi. <verse eid="2KI 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 9:25" />Pecai Jehu pe kedibe Bidkar dage rangdi, “Pecu pwalu nah Jezreelme pei Naboth luh gage pecu kelien gaidi. Nsung lulo dainzwa anai ngngwa pe pei Ahab cai cwa keladau, RAMPAUBE sam aide pwa pecu mmau gai: <verse eid="2KI 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 9:26" />‘Nziene Ih Naboth jai nah pe napeidung jai ngau, RAMPAUBE ndugai, nah Ih luh aika de ncu saja peu bi zie, RAMPAUBE ndu liagai.’ Cu cine, pecu pwalu delwe luh aide gage pecu kelien gaidi, RAMPAUBE sampet kai kebeu nzwa.”<verse eid="2KI 9:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 9:27" />Judah gwangpei Ahaziah aide ngau luge, pa Beth Haggan lampui ga kelwa tetdi. Dede Jehu pe caisui gwang, nah rangdi, “Pecu de bagi gage teitset gaidi,” nah penui pecu Ibleam nam tai ga, Gur nam ga kenghang gade kap. Ahaziah Megiddo gage pak gaidi nah cikade tsaidi. <verse eid="2KI 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 9:28" />Pe kilame bagi gage pe paau Jerusalem ga punggwang nah pecu David namdi ga pe peime rau taiga kungdi.<verse eid="2KI 9:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 9:29" />Cidau Ahab napei Joram hegwang teikelu mmi kereieket bekum Ahaziah Judah reu hegwang tei cudi.<verse eid="2KI 9:29" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jezebel de Teitsetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 9:30" />Jehu Jezreel ga gwang keludau, Jezebel cide siulu, eh pa pe miak gage ma ketau gailu, pe peutam lamlui, nah hebaki gade piegai. <verse eid="2KI 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 9:31" />Jehu rieki ga nlüt kela dau, pa pe dage rangdi, “Nang Zimri, n mpaube de dapketset be, nang kezuyi teu gwangla ni?” <verse eid="2KI 9:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 9:32" />Jehu hebaki ga pie nghang nah rangdi, “Cau a lambie bam no? Cau?” Ge eunuch hangna hangcum ge pie nghung gai. <verse eid="2KI 9:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 9:33" />Cine Jehu rangdi, “Pecu kelien nghung gai.” Cine penui Jezebel de kelien nghung gai, nah pe jai kesa tangdeu ga nah hekündung de tei lwadi, nah Jehu pereu ga tetkah. <verse eid="2KI 9:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 9:34" />Jehu hegwangki nlüt keludau, pa matyei nah sak. Pecai pa rangdi, “Reset kegai pui de pie rengei lwe pecu kung dilu, kedanemene pa au hegwangpei napui lu.” <verse eid="2KI 9:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 9:35" />Penui pecu teukung kera mie, dede penui pe peura, pe pi, nah pe badeu gwale pe paau keda ngaulu tadi. <verse eid="2KI 9:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 9:36" />Cine penui cailigwang nah Jehu de ranglia gai. Pa rangdi, “Aide RAMPAUBE sam pe kilabe Tishbeme Elijah da pau gai kebeu deda, rang eh, ‘Jezreelme deu ga heteudung ne Jezebel paau tyei luzie, <verse eid="2KI 9:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 9:37" />nah Jezebel pum de makauteu ge nzwa Jezreel deu heluhdung ga zangra dizie, ciciude migede, “Aide Jezebel da,” de eh ranggai lak dizie.’”<verse eid="2KI 9:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="2KI 10" />
  <para style="s">Ahab Kelak de Teitsetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 10:1" />Cu Samaria namdi ga hegwangpei Ahab leuhme mina riakhena lungh bamla. Samaria ga Jezreel namdi keteume dage Jehu laisiudung raulu delwe penui dage langgai, nah kecingmedung de si eh Ahab leuhme mapie kelamedung dage, ainzwa rang eh, <verse eid="2KI 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 10:2" />“Nnui mpaube leuhmedung nnui da la, nah nnui bagidung nah hekündung de nah renei kwakelu namdi nah hereunetdung ge de bam. Cine, laisiu aide nnui da gwanglu herizi, <verse eid="2KI 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 10:3" />nnui mpaube leuhme kakga de yitube nah petautube de kedetlu, delwe pecu pe pei hegwangbam gage kailu, delwe nnui mpaube hegwang ria ziemne regilu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 10:4" />Dede penui au ngngidi nah penuikatei kak gade rangdi, “Pielo, hegwangpei kena de Jehu dwa saplu ma. Cine dainzwa anui saplu lai?” <verse eid="2KI 10:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 10:5" />Ge hegwangki kerengeibe peide, nah namdi reu kedibe peide, nah kecingmedung de si eh, nah hename de nkwet cuh kecume, Jehu dage sam lang keligai eh ainzwa ranggai, “Anui n kilamedung lie. Nang anui de teilo kebeu leune anui tei zie. Anui mige de de hegwangpei tei lak. N dwaga de petaube tei lulo.” <verse eid="2KI 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 10:6" />Pecai Jehu pie pekenabe penui dage laisiu raugai, rang eh, “Nnui magade a lambie bam lie cai, nah nnui a kwa kingnei zie lie cai, nnui mpaube leuhme pei peudung pwalu delwe ncünne tingcang aipau ting ga Jezreel a da gwanglu.” Hegwangpei leuhmedung, pumpei riakhena ge, penuide pie rengei cu kebeume, namdi ga kenlangme da bam. <verse eid="2KI 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 10:7" />Cine laisiu penui da kegwang dau, penui hegwangpei napeidung de ngngwa lwe penuide teitsetdi, riakhena ge, penui peudung marakdung gage kailu, delwe penuide de Jezreel ga Jehu dage lang gaidi. <verse eid="2KI 10:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 10:8" />Samgwame ge Jehu da gwang eh ranggai, “Penui hegwangpei napeidung peudung punggwang luda.” Cine pa rangdi, “Cidungde keheswa sauna tei lwe kirie dwa gage tingcang kecang kailu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 10:9" />Tingcang Jehu tet pet delwe saplu, nah mina pelane dage rangdi, “Nnui zie ma. Pielo, Ih a mpaube de teitset kera heciem riem lwe pecu teitset dida, dede caune aidung pelane de teitsetdi dino? <verse eid="2KI 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 10:10" />Cu nnui RAMPAUBE sam de, pa Ahab kelak ha kerang de ket de hangdeu ga cakmie di lak lie kecu ci mcilu da, kedanemene RAMPAUBE pe kilabe Elijah dage pa kerang de teidi delu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 10:11" />Cine Jehu Jezreel ga kebam Ahab kelak bang kebam pelane de, nah pe mina kenlangme pelane, pe zangme kemname, nah pe cingkumedung, de teitsetdi, penui hangge de bang kemaktane.<verse eid="2KI 10:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 10:12" />Pecai Jehu cuhlu delwe tetdi; pa Samaria ga miedi. Pa meurün kekwame ki Beth Eked ga gwang keladau, <verse eid="2KI 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 10:13" />pa Judah gwangpei Ahaziah siname de redaulu. Jehu penui dage rangdi, “Nnui cau no?” Penui keligai, “Anui au Ahaziah siname lie, nah hegwangpei name de nah Hegwangpui Jezebel name de kelum gai kerane anui hung lalie.” <verse eid="2KI 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 10:14" />Jehu pekatei pe minadung dage rangdi, “Penuide ring eh tuilu.” Cine penuide ring eh tuilu delwe Beth Eked tekwa gage penuide teitset gaidi, mina riakdai pelane de. Pa mige de de peu ringbam ma.<verse eid="2KI 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 10:15" />Jehu cikade tet kedidau, pa Recab napei Jehonadab pecu redau kera gwang eh redaulu. Jehu pecu kelumgai delwe pe dage rangdi, “N mlung ada bammi, a mlung n da kebam nzwa eh?” Jehonadab keligai, “yeo lie.” Jehu rangdi, “Magade ciciu cai, n ba acu peulo.” Cine pa Jehu de pe ba peu, nah Jehu Jehonadab de ngngwalu delwe pecu ngngwa bagi ga nlütdi. <verse eid="2KI 10:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 10:16" />Jehu rangdi, “Acu ngngwa gwang eh RAMPAUBE ziemne Ih a lung kaikebam pielo.” Cine pe gu bagi ga pa Jonadab de ngngwa cwa lwe tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 10:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 10:17" />Pa Samaria ga gwang kelu dau, Samaria ga Ahab leuhme gade bang kebam pelane de Jehu teitsetdi, pa Ahab hegwang ria de tei msiadi kemaktane, penuide RAMPAUBE sam gade ndaa penuide rang kebeu nzwa eh, pa Elijah de rang kebeu de.<verse eid="2KI 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Baal Gwame de Teitsetkedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 10:18" />Pecai Jehu mina pelane de qu hekwalu delwe penui dage rangdi, “Ahab manage Baal gwa tei dida, dede Jehu pe gwa tei kiee gwa zie. <verse eid="2KI 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 10:19" />Cu ciziemne Baal caihakecime pelane de ada ge qu hekwalu, pecu reca kelame leune de, nah pe cingkume pelane de. Peu mige de de bang diso, kedanemene Ih Baal de ratak kedi ge teibeu kera bamlu. Keheibe de gwang kemakme ring gai lak.” Dede Jehu aide cwa eh teidi, Baal de reca kelame de teitset kera kecet gade. <verse eid="2KI 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 10:20" />Jehu rangdi, “Baal de reca kera ting ge riet lulo.” Cine penui cide sah gai. <verse eid="2KI 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 10:21" />Ge Jehu sam Israel deu pelane gage langgai nah Baal de reca kelame leune gwanglu, cine mige de gwang tadi kemak bam ma cika. Penui Baal kerecaki ga lütlu, nah cide tuge lamde kedale tu kecang puilu. <verse eid="2KI 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 10:22" />Jehu cingkupei pai kekaibung kerengeibe dage rangdi, “Baal de reca kelame pelane ziemne paidung keu mpet lulo.” Cine cipau pei de penuide paidung keu mpet beu. <verse eid="2KI 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 10:23" />Cine Jehu Recab napei Jehonadab de ngngwa lwe Baal kerecaki ga lütdi, nah pa Baal de reca kelame dage rangdi, “Peei pielo nah peu nnui kak ga RAMPAUBE kilame de peu migede de nnui da bam helo, dede Baal de reca kelame rünne bam lu.” <verse eid="2KI 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 10:24" />Pecai penai ratakdung nah keru recadung teigai beu kera lütdi. Cu Jehu hegwale sap kebam mina riakheset de kedetlu, nah pa penui dage rangbeu, “Magade Ih nnui ba gage ngngwa gwang gai kebeu minadung hangge de pakdi cai, peu cipau peide de pak kedibe de teitsetdi zie, pak kedibe teilung ziemne.”<verse eid="2KI 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 10:25" />Cine Jehu keru reca tei canglu herizi, pa kekwame nah kedimedung dage rangdi, “Lütlwe penuide teitsetdi. Peu mige de de mpet so.” Cine penui penuide kiengtie tu le teitsetdi, nah kekwabe nah kedimedung penuide kelien mpetdi delwe Baal kerecaki helung le lütdi. <verse eid="2KI 10:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 10:26" />Penui tangtsu tsiadung Baal kerecaki ga kebamdung de teu kerei mpetlu delwe penui cidungde rudi. <verse eid="2KI 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 10:27" />Pecai penui Baal tsusum de tei ngkaudi, nah Baal kerecaki de tei msiadi delwe cide heteuki ge teidi, henai kecang de cide cinzwa eh bam. <verse eid="2KI 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 10:28" />Ainzwa eh Jehu Israel gade Baal de reca kecu tei nggadi.<verse eid="2KI 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 10:29" />Dede Jehu Jeroboam napei Nebat kemaudung de gidi ma, cide cai, Bethel penai Dan ga kecak tumseudung de reca kecu, cide le pa Israel de peu kemau tei. <verse eid="2KI 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 10:30" />Cine RAMPAUBE Jehu dage rangdi, “Kedanemene nang adwa de petau lie kecube tei mmi kelune, nah a mlung ga ma pelane kebam nzwa Ahab leuhme dage tei kegaine, n leuhme Israel hegwangbam ga ceheu pe mdaibe kecang bam zie.” <verse eid="2KI 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 10:31" />Dede Jehu RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang, zai de pe mlung pelane tei eh mzailu ma. Pa Jeroboam maudung gade nreu tetdi ma, pa Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegai gade.<verse eid="2KI 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 10:32" />Cipau tingbadung dau RAMPAUBE Israel dage pe cuikuidung tei mceudi, nah Hazael Israelme de Israel deu raidung gade ngamlu, <verse eid="2KI 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 10:33" />Jordan kepetle bie gade, Gilead deu pelane, Gad leuhme, nah Reuben leuhme, nah Manasseh leuhme, Aroer gade, cide Arnon Langkam taiga, Gilead gade Bashan kecang. <verse eid="2KI 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 10:34" />Jehu tadung kedadung cai, pa teikedi pelane, nah pe kengkieng pelane, cidung de Israel gwangpeidung tei kegwangdung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 10:35" />Jehu pe paume nzwa tsaidi, nah penui pecu Samaria gage kungdi. Pecai pe napei Jehoahaz pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 10:36" />Jehu Samaria ga mmi ngkaieheset Israel reu hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 10:36" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="2KI 11" />
  <para style="s">Athaliah nah Joash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 11:1" />Cidau Ahaziah pui, Athaliah, pe napei tsai kedi ngau luge, pa hegwang name pelane de teitset cuhdi. <verse eid="2KI 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 11:2" />Dede hegwangpei Jehoram napui nah Ahaziah tipui Jehosheba, Ahaziah napei Joash de ngngwalu, nah hegwang napeidung de teitset kedime kakgade pecu nah pe nkütpui de teu mbaidi; pa penaide zeubung ge gage kaidi. Penui pecu Athaliah dade teu mbaidi ciu eh pecu teitsetdi melu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 11:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 11:3" />Pa RAMPAUBE ki ga mbai eh mmi herok ge peda bamdi, Athaliah hegwang tei eh hangdeube reu di kebam tingdau.<verse eid="2KI 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 11:4" />Mmi hena bekum, Jehoiada samdung langgai delwe Caritme nah kekwame pehaireu muibedung de ngngwa gwang, nah penui de pekatei peda ngngwa gwanglu, RAMPAUBE kerecaki gage. Pa penuide ngngwa samkak ge teilu, delwe pa penuide peu RAMPAUBE ki gade sampetlu. Pecai pa penuide hegwangpei napei de liagai. <verse eid="2KI 11:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 11:5" />Pa penuide aja kai eh ranggai, “Nnui aide teibi maisia. Nnui zicum gade zi ge Sabbath benai gwang kecume, hegwang ki kwa zie, <verse eid="2KI 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 11:6" />nah zicum gade zige Sur Rieki ga kwa zie, nah zi cum gade zige kekwameki cai ga herieki kebam ga kwa zie.” <verse eid="2KI 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 11:7" />Nah hemaa kedadung kena de Sabbath benai hegwa tei kemakme, nnui hegwangpei ziemne RAMPAUBE kide kwalu maisia. <verse eid="2KI 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 11:8" />Nnui mileune de pe reunetdung pe ba ga pwalwe hegwangpei de twagwa lu maisia. Nnui taiga kelüt keheibe dede teitsetdi lu. Nnui hegwangpei kempet kenlüt leu ga kwalu maisia.<verse eid="2KI 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 11:9" />Cine pehaireu muibedung cingkupei Jehoiada aja kai kebeu leune mzailu. Mi hange ge kecu pe minadung, Sabbath benai hegwa tei kera gwang keramedung nah Sabbath benai hegwa ketei mtak keramedung de ngngwalu; nah penui cingkupei Jehoiada da gwanglu. <verse eid="2KI 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 11:10" />Pecai cingkupei Jehoiada pehaireu muibedung de RAMPAUBE ki ga kebam, Hegwangpei David gu hengeidung nah hegeudung pwapeu. <verse eid="2KI 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 11:11" />Cine kekwame hegwangpei de twagwa saplu, mi hangge ge kecu pe reunet pe ba gage pwalwe, kerecaki zetle bie gade hile bie, recabam taiga nah kerecaki ga. <verse eid="2KI 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 11:12" />Cidau Jehoiada hegwangpei napei Joash de ngngwa mpetlu, pe peu gage hegwangpeurwa kailu delwe samkakkelu zaidung de pecu pwa peudi. Delwe penui pecu hegwang teilu eh pecu keniaklu. Penui bapeu eh rangdi, “Hegwangpei de peu ring ketiebe teilo!”<verse eid="2KI 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 11:13" />Athaliah kekwame nah minadung kwa siu luge, pa RAMPAUBE ki ga minadung da gwanglu. <verse eid="2KI 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 11:14" />Pa piegai, ge ainie, hegwangpei hezaibe nzwa hetsia taiga sapbam, nah kedimedung nah teluikekwame hegwangpei taiga bam. Mina leune penui suiyi delwe teluidung kwabam. Ge Athaliah pe niadung hiet delwe sahbakgai, “Heciem kesia! Heciem kesia!” <verse eid="2KI 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 11:15" />Ge cingkupei Jehoiada pehaireu muibedung, reugwame reu kedimedung de aja kai eh ranggai, “Pecu kekwame ria kena kakgade ngngwa mpetlu. Keheibe de pecai sui cai, cipau dede kiengtie le teitsetdi lu.” Kedanemene cingkupei rangdi, “RAMPAUBE ki gade pecu teitset diso.” <verse eid="2KI 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 11:16" />Cine penui pecu tuilu, pa hekündung hegwangki ga kelüt lampui ga gwang canglu ge, delwe cika ge pecu teitsetdi.<verse eid="2KI 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 11:17" />Ge Jehoiada RAMPAUBE, nah hegwangpei nah minadung kakga penui RAMPAUBE minadung zielie kecu samkak ge teilu. Nah hegwangpei nah minadung kakgade samkak ge teilu. <verse eid="2KI 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 11:18" />Cine minadung pelane Baal ki ga mie delwe cide tei ngkaudi. Penui Baal recabamdung tei pangdi nah pe miedung de tei takcaidi, delwe penui Baal cingkupei Mattan de cipau recabamdung dwa gade teitsetdi. Delwe cingkupei Jehoiada RAMPAUBE kerecaki reu kekwame de kedetlu. <verse eid="2KI 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 11:19" />Jehoiada pehaireu muibedung, Caritme, reketme, nah cipau deu ga mina pelane de ngngwalu, nah penui ket tei eh hegwangpei de RAMPAUBE ki gade ngngwa nghunglu delwe hegwangpei ki ga kekwame rieki lampui gade penui lütdi. Joash hegwangbam ga bamlu. <verse eid="2KI 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 11:20" />Cine cipau deu ga minadung pelane penui suiyidi, nah namdi de zing dedi Athaliah de hegwangpei ki gade kiengtie le teitset kedi cai.<verse eid="2KI 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 11:21" />Joash mmi hena dige pa hegwang teicuhdi.<verse eid="2KI 11:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="2KI 12" />
  <para style="s">Joash Kerecaki keretak</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 12:1" />Jehu hegwang tei kelu mmi hena bekum, Joash hegwang tei cuhdi, pa Jerusalem ga mmi riakdai hegwang tei. Pe pui zi Zibiah, pa au Beershebame. <verse eid="2KI 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 12:2" />Joash RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube tei muila, kedanemene cingkupei Jehoiada pe dage ranglia kebeune. <verse eid="2KI 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 12:3" />Dede nlumkemakme nidung keugi dima. Minadung cude ratak tei nah perim kehengui nlumkemak nidung gage rugai la.<verse eid="2KI 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 12:4" />Joash cingkume dage ranggai, “RAMPAUBE kiga kemci makai teu kegwang rangkang pelane hekwalu, hange ge dade keu kela rangkang de, hezi kerau gade ha kelade mede, mige sampet kegai gade ngau kelude, mede RAMPAUBE ne helung tei beu eh minadung suiyi makai keu gwang kelade, <verse eid="2KI 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 12:5" />cingkume rangkang keteume penui hangge dade rangkang keulu kerabe iciu eh kerecaki ga siakedi kengau keheibe de retaklu kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 12:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 12:6" />Dede Joash Hegwang tei kelu mmi ngkaiekecum bekum kecang de cingkume kerecaki retak ma. <verse eid="2KI 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 12:7" />Cine Hegwangpei Joash, cingkupei Jehoiada nah cingku kedame de ku gai, pa penui dage rangdi, “Nnui daitei eh kerecaki ga magede retak meno? Cu gade nnui rangkang keu kelame dade keusi talu, dede kerecaki retak kera ziemne hekwa kelude keulu delwe nah retaklu kebuime de cide peulu.” <verse eid="2KI 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 12:8" />Cine cingkume minadung dade rangkang keu tadi kera nah kerecaki de retak tadi kera penui kesuisam lu.<verse eid="2KI 12:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 12:9" />Meliene, cingkupei Jehoiada ubung pwalu, pegum gage peki teitiplu, delwe ubung de recabam taiga ge kaizeu, RAMPAUBE ki ga lüt ge zetle ge. Cingkume kerecaki kimui kwa kebamme RAMPAUBE ki ga rangkang kegwang pelane pwa ubung de gage kailu.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">12:9 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MRK 12:41">Mrk. 12:41</ref></char></note> <verse eid="2KI 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 12:10" />Keheidaude penui ubung de rangkang pui kedi ngau luge, hegwangki ga keraube penai cingku kedibe gwang delwe rangkang bungdung gage kaidi nah cide peilu, RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade rangkang ngaukelu. <verse eid="2KI 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 12:11" />Penui rangkang mdet kelude RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga pie kerengeime ba gage kaibeu dila. Penui cide RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga tsingtaketeime nah bata tei kebamme de peu dila, <verse eid="2KI 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 12:12" />nah tangtsu ta keteime nah tangtsu kepangme zie teibeu la, RAMPAUBE kerecaki retak kerane tsing nah tangtsu lui kedi ziemne, nah cide retak kerane mpet maikesia pelane ziemne. <verse eid="2KI 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 12:13" />Dede cipau rangkang de RAMPAUBE ki ga keu kegwang ketde rangkanggeu piakdung, mitaubungdung kemtautiedung, hekwak, teluidung, mede kecak mede rangkanggeu nia ge ketei zie tei ma. <verse eid="2KI 12:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 12:14" />Penui aipau rangkang de RAMPAUBE ki retak bam kecume de peudi. <verse eid="2KI 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 12:15" />Cipau reude, bata kerengeime dade rangkang ha rang mci liagai kera gede tei dima, kedanemene mina aidungde au masangsüt kecune. <verse eid="2KI 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 12:16" />Dede teimau kedi recadung ziemne kaikebeu rangkang nah kemau recadung ziemne kaikebeu rangkang de RAMPAUBE kerecaki gage kai ma, kedanemene cide cingkupeidung gu kecune.<verse eid="2KI 12:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 12:17" />Cidau Aram Gwangpei Hazael Gath de gwaketang nah regi, delwe cide gwalu. Pecai Hazael Jerusalem gwaketang kera cetlu. <verse eid="2KI 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 12:18" />Judah gwangpei Joash pepei Judah gwangpeidung Jehoshaphat nah Jehoram nah Ahaziah teimci kedi, nah pa ne teimci kegai de ma pelane keulu, nah RAMPAUBE ki nah hegwangki ga mania kibungdung gade kecakdung ngaukelu pelane Aram gwangpei Hazael dage langgai beudi. Pecai Hazael Jerusalem gade tetdi.<verse eid="2KI 12:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 12:19" />Joash tei kegwang pelane, cidungde Judah gwangdung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 12:20" />Pe kilamedung ngngwa heciem riem cuhdi; penui Silla kehung lampui, Beth Millo gade Joash de gwaketang. <verse eid="2KI 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 12:21" />Shimeath napei Jozabad<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kehegwa laisiukwakdung kesa ga </char><char style="fqa">Jozacar, de eh bam. </char> </note> nah Shomer napei Jehozabad, pe kilamedung, pecu gwaketang, nah pa tsaidi. Penui Joash de David namdi ga pe paume de kekung gage kungdi, nah pe napei Amaziah pe bam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 12:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="2KI 13" />
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Jehoahaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 13:1" />Ahaziah napei Joash Judah gwangpei hegwangtei kelu mmi ngkaiekecum bekum, Jehu napei Jehoahaz Samaria ga Israelme reu hegwang teilu; pa mmi kereiehena hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 13:2" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi nah Nebat napei Jeroboam kemaudung de nzuidi, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe; nah Jehoahaz cidungde gade nreu luma. <verse eid="2KI 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 13:3" />RAMPAUBE Israelme de perata sütdi, nah pa penui de Aram gwangpei Hazael ba gage nah Hazael napei Ben Hadad ba gage peudai dai gaibeu. <verse eid="2KI 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 13:4" />Cine Jehoahaz RAMPAUBE dage kiegai, nah RAMPAUBE kingnei lu kedanemene pa Israelme de teikeherei cu ngau, Aram gwangpei penuide dainzwa teikeherei bambi kecu. <verse eid="2KI 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 13:5" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israelme de kelilu kera mige de langgai beu, nah penui Aramme ba gade paklu, nah Israelme penui kiga pedwa le lunghbam kela nzwa lunghdai lu. <verse eid="2KI 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 13:6" />Dede, penui Jeroboam, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe kilungme kemau de pütti ma, nah penui cidung de tei jüja bam; nah Asherah hetsia de Samaria ga bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 13:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 13:7" />Aramme Jehoahaz de hekwen keteume mina riakngei, bagi kerei, nah hepi reugwame cang kerei gwale kaidiak tadi, kedanemene Aram gwangpei penuide ngkapdi nah penuide hecaipung ga ciurie ge nzwa teidi. <verse eid="2KI 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 13:8" />Jehoahaz tei gwangkedi ha kedadung, nah pa tei kegai leune nah pe kengkieng, cidungde Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 13:9" />Cine Jehoahaz pe paume nzwa tsaidi, nah penui pecu Samaria gage kungdi. Pe napei Jehoash pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Jehoash</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 13:10" />Judah gwangpei Joash hegwang tei kelu mmi camreiehena bekum, Jehoahaz napei Jehoash Samaria ga Israel hegwang teilu; pa mmi kereieherok hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 13:11" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa de kemau teidi. Pa Nebat napei Jeroboam, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de kette gidi ma, dede pa cidungde nziudi. <verse eid="2KI 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 13:12" />Jehoash teikedi ha kedadung, nah pa tei kegai leune, nah Judah gwangpei Amaziah de ngngwa regi kecu ga pe kengkieng, Israel gwangdung hakwak gage raupwa la meni? <verse eid="2KI 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 13:13" />Jehoash pe paume nzwa tsaidi, nah Jeroboam pe hegwangbam ga bamdi. Jehoash de Samaria gage Israel gwangpeidung raukie gage kungdi.<verse eid="2KI 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 13:14" />Elisha mateei pung eh mradi cide ne pecai pa pung caidi, cine Israel gwangpei Jehoash pe taiga hung eh pe ziemne hapdi. Pa rangdi, “Apei, apei, Israelme bagidung nah hekwen keteume ncu ngngwa tetti lau delie.” <verse eid="2KI 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 13:15" />Elisha pe dage rangdi, “Lakpi ge nah lakpitsidung pwalu,” cine Joash lakpi nah lakpitsidung pwalu. <verse eid="2KI 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 13:16" />Elisha Israel gwangpei dage rangdi, “Lakpi gage n ba kailu,” cine pa lakpi gage peba kailu. Pecai Elisha hegwangpei ba gage peba kailu. <verse eid="2KI 13:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 13:17" />Elisha rangdi, “Naimiak kepetle kebaki de ngkei gailo,” cine pa cide ngkeigai. Nah Elisha rangdi, “Kapgai,” ge pa kapgai. Elisha rangdi, “Aide RAMPAUBE ngkieng kelu lakpitsi, Aram reu ngkieng kelu lakpitsi, nang Aramme de Aphek gade ketang zie nang penuide ngamlu kemaktane.” <verse eid="2KI 13:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 13:18" />Pecai Elisha rangdi, “Lakpitsidung de keulu,” cine Joash cidungde keulu. Pa Israel gwangpei dage rang, “Hangdeu gage kapgai,” nah pa hangdeu gage piacum kapgai, pecai mtakdi. <verse eid="2KI 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 13:19" />Dede Tinggwang minabe pecu pe ratadi nah rangdi, “Nang pia mengei mede pia herok hangdeu gage kapgai kerabe. Iciucai nang Aram de ngkapzingdi kemaktane gwaketang luzie dede nang cu Aram de piacum rünne ketang zie.”<verse eid="2KI 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 13:20" />Pecai Elisha tsaidi, nah penui pecu kungdi. Cu Moabme maadung mmi ramsang kum mmi kerai dau penui deu gwalütla. <verse eid="2KI 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 13:21" />Penui mipeige de kung kebam dau, penui Moabme maa de ngau, cine penui ketsaipau de Elisha rau gage keling gaidi. Mipei be Elisha radung de tunggai herizi, pa ring dailu eh cuh sapdi.<verse eid="2KI 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 13:22" />Aram gwangpei Hazael Jehoahaz hegwang ketei ting pelane Israelme de tei kehereidi. <verse eid="2KI 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 13:23" />Dede RAMPAUBE au Israelme dade pezai yi, nah penuide ngaunggia nah penui ziemne helungniedi, pa Abraham, Isaac, nah Jacob dage samkakkelu ziemne. Cine RAMPAUBE penuide ngkapdi ma, nah pa penuide pedade teu mdeidi ma. <verse eid="2KI 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 13:24" />Aram gwangpei Hazael tsaidi, nah pe napei Ben Hadad pe keleu ga hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 13:25" />Jehoahaz napei Jehoash Hazael napei Ben Hadad dade namdidung pe pei Jehoahaz dade hereu ketei gade keuteu kedi dung de keu dailu. Jehoash pecu pia cum gwaketang, nah pa Israel namdi cidungde ngaudailu.<verse eid="2KI 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="2KI 14" />
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Amaziah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 14:1" />Jehoahaz napei Jehoash Israel ga hegwang teikelu mmi pekenabe kum, Joash napei Amaziah, Judah gwangpei, hegwang tei cuhdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 14:2" />Pa hegwang tei keludau pa mmi ngkaiemengei di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi ngkaiehekui hegwang tei. Pe cai Jerusalemme, pe zi Jehoaddan. <verse eid="2KI 14:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 14:3" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu, dede pe pau David nzwa ma. Pa ma pelane pe pei nzwa Joash teigwang. <verse eid="2KI 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 14:4" />Dede nlumkemakme reca nidung tei ngkau dima. Mina cu kecang nlumkemakme reca nidung gage ratak teigai nah kehengui rugai jüja ladi. <verse eid="2KI 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 14:5" />Aiciu la pe hegwang tei ngkienglu herizi, pa pe pei, hegwangpei de daptset kedi kilame de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 14:6" />Dede pa mide dapketsetme name de teitsetdi ma; meliene, pa Moses zai laisiukwak gage rauteu kela nzwa RAMPAUBE ne rang kebeubedung de mzuilu eh, ranggai, “Mipuipei de penui name mau ziemne teitsetdi lak, mede hename de penui puipei mau ziemne teitsetdi lak. Meliene, mina keheibe de pekatei pe mau ziemne teitset zie.” <verse eid="2KI 14:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 14:7" />Pa Mcai langkam gade Edom reugwame cang kerei de teitsetdi; pa hereu gade Sela namdi de tuilu nah cide de Joktheel lie qula, henai kecang de cinzwa qula. <verse eid="2KI 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 14:8" />Pecai Amaziah samgwame de Jehoahaz napei Jehoash Jehu capei Israel gwangpei de langgai eh ranggai, “Anui hereu gade gwang kezumok eh redau go.” <verse eid="2KI 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 14:9" />Dede Israel gwangpei Jehoash samgwame de Judah gwangpei Amaziah da langgai cailigai eh ranggai, “Lebanon ga kebam hetupui ge Lebanon ga cedar bang ge dage sam langgai eh ranggai, ‘N napui de peu a napei naulo,’ dede Lebanon ga makaune ge kahgwang eh hetupui de dau ngkaudi. <verse eid="2KI 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 14:10" />Nang Edom de ngam kesang luda, nah ngang dida. Nang ngkieng kelu dega hegie bamlu, dede kilung ga bamlu, kedanemene daitei nang ncu nah Judah de kekap peu kerabe rünne peei lano?” <verse eid="2KI 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 14:11" />Dede Amaziah kingnei raudi. Cine Israel gwangpei Jehoash gwakwtang eh pa nah Judah gwangpei Amaziah Judah deu Beth Shemesh gade hangge gede keregi. <verse eid="2KI 14:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 14:12" />Judahme de Israel ne ngamdi, nah mina keheibe de peki riep gage pakgai di. <verse eid="2KI 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 14:13" />Israel gwangpei Jehoash, Beth Shemesh gade Judah gwangpei Amaziah, Jehoash napei Ahaziah capei de tuilu. Pa Jerusalem ga gwanglu delwe Jerusalem kirie de tei ngkaudi Ephraim Rieki gade kimiak Rieki ga kecang, pemdei cubit hai mdai nage. <verse eid="2KI 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 14:14" />Pa rangkanggeu nah kecak pelane nah maniadung leune RAMPAUBE ki gade ngaukeludung nah hegwangki mabam pemi kehung pelane punglu eh tuikelume de ngngwalwe Samaria ga cailigwangdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 14:15" />Jehoash tei kegwang kedadung nah pa tei kegai leune, pe kengkieng, nah pa Judah gwangpei Amaziah de ngngwa hereu ketei ha cidungde Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 14:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 14:16" />Pecai Jehoash pe paumedung nzwa tsaidi nah Samaria ga Israel gwangpeidung de kekung gage kungdi, nah pe napei Jeroboam bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 14:17" />Israel gwangpei, Jehoahaz napei Jehoash tsaikedi cai, Judah gwangpei Amaziah Joash napei mmi kereimengei lunghlu. <verse eid="2KI 14:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 14:18" />Amaziah tei kegwang kedadung, cidungde Judah gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 14:19" />Penui Amaziah de teitsetdi kera Jerusalem gade heciem ge riem, nah pa Lachish gage pak gaidi. Pa Lachish gage pakgai di, dede penui minadung de langgai eh pecu Lachish ga zuimie eh cikade pecu teitsetdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 14:20" />Penui pecu hekwen ge gage pung cailigwangdi, nah pecu David namdi ga paumedung kekung gage kungdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 14:21" />Judah minadung pelane ngngwa Azariah, mmi kereieherok gede peu pe pei Amaziah bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 14:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 14:22" />Hegwangpei Amaziah pe paume de nzwa tsai kedicai, Azariah Elath retaklu delwe Judah de peu daidi.<verse eid="2KI 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Jeroboam Kenabe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 14:23" />Joash napei Amaziah Judah ga hegwang teikelu mmi kereimengei bekum, Jehoash napei Jeroboam Samaria ga hegwang tei cuhdi, pa mmi riakdaieket hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 14:24" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Pa Nebat napei Jeroboam Israel de kemau puisau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de gidi ma. <verse eid="2KI 14:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 14:25" />Pa Israel rai Lebo Hamath gade Arabah Jaaidi ga kecang tui dailu, RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang samdung de mzai eh Gath Hepher gade kegwang pe kilabe caihakecibe Jonah, Amittai napei dage sampet kebeude. <verse eid="2KI 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 14:26" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE Israelme keherei kebam de ngau kelune, cide pelane ziemne rei süt kecu ge, hebaangme nah hebaang teikemakme ziemne de, nah Israelme de ngha kera migede gahdi. <verse eid="2KI 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 14:27" />Cine RAMPAUBE tiggim kangde Israel de pa ngkap zingdi laklie ranggai; meliene, pa penuide Jeroboam Jehoash napei ba gade kelibeu. <verse eid="2KI 14:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 14:28" />Jeroboam tei kegwang kedadung, pa tei kedi pelane, pe kengkieng, pa hereu ketei nah Israel ziemne Judah da kebam Damascus penai Hamath de ngau dai kelu aidungde Israel gwangdung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 14:29" />Jeroboam pe paume, Israel gwangdung nzwa tsaidi, nah pe napei Zechariah pebam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 14:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="2KI 15" />
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Azariah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 15:1" />Jeroboam Israel gwangpei hegwang teikelu mmi ngkaiehena bekum, Judah gwangpei Azariah Amaziah napei hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 15:2" />Azariah mmi kereieherok dige pa hegwang teilu, nah Jerusalem ga pa mmi riakngeiekena hegwangtei. Pe pui au Jerusalemme, pe zi cai Jekoliah. <verse eid="2KI 15:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 15:3" />Pa pe pei Amaziah tei kegai nzwa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 15:4" />Ciuliede, nlumkemakme reca nidung de au keugi dima. Minadung cu kecang de cikage ratak nah marim kehengui rugai la. <verse eid="2KI 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 15:5" />RAMPAUBE hegwangpei de teikeherei gai iciu eh pa ketsai benai kecangde mpa ladi nah ki ketsam ga lunghdi. Hegwangpei napei Jotham, pe kilungme nah mina reu kedi teidi. <verse eid="2KI 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 15:6" />Azariah tei kegwang kedadung, pa tei kedi leune, Judah gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 15:7" />Cine Azariah pe paume de nzwa tsaidi; penui pecu David namdi ga pe paume de kekung gage kungdi. Pe napei Jotham pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Zechariah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 15:8" />Judah gwangpei Azariah hegwang tei kelu mmi camreieheset bekum, Jeroboam napei Zechariah Samaria ga kei herok ge Israel reu hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 15:9" />Pa pe pei tei kegai nzwa, RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Pa Nebat napei Jeroboam, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de gidi ma. <verse eid="2KI 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 15:10" />Shallum Jabesh napei Zechariah de teitset kera heciemtei di, pecu Ibleam gade gwaketang, nah pecu teitsetdi. Pecai pa pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 15:11" />Zechariah tei kegai kedadung, cidungde Israel gwangpei hakwak gage rau pwala. <verse eid="2KI 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 15:12" />RAMPAUBE Jehu dage sampet kebeude tei canglu, “N leuhme ceheu mdai kecang Israel hegwang ga hegwang teizie,” de kebeude.<verse eid="2KI 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Shallum</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 15:13" />Judah gwangpei Azariah hegwang tei kelu mmi camreiehekui bekum Shallum Jabesh napei hegwang teilu, nah pa Samaria ga keige rünne hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 15:14" />Menahem Gadi napei Tirzah gade Samaria ga nghang. Samaria gade pa Shallum Jabesh napei de gwaketang. Pa pecu teitsetdi nah pebam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 15:15" />Shallum tei kegai kedadung nah pa mbai eh tei kedi hade, cidungde Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala. <verse eid="2KI 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 15:16" />Pecai Menahem Tiphsah, cika kelunghme pelane, nah Tirzah twagwa kebam deuraidung de gwaketang, kedanemene penui pecu namdi de ngkeibeu kemakne. Cine pa cide gwaketang, nah pa renam cika tetlak kelapui zadung rakpop ciodi. <note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Tiphsah de mene, </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">laisiukwak kehegwa ga nah keheci kesa ga, </char><char style="fqa">Tappuah </char> de peila. </note><verse eid="2KI 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Menahem</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 15:17" />Judah gwangpei Azariah hegwang tei kelu mmi camreiehekui bekum, Gadi napei Menahem Israel reu hegwang teilu; Pa Samaria ga mmi kerei hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 15:18" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa kemau teidi. Pe teilung pelane, pa Nebat napei Jeroboam, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de gidi ma. <verse eid="2KI 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 15:19" />Pecai Assyria gwangpei Pul hangdeube de renia gwang, nah Menahem Pul de rangkanggeu talent cangge peu, iciu eh Pul ngha pa ngaulu eh pe ba ga kebam Israel gwangram teingkienglu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 15:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 15:20" />Menahem Assyria gwangpei de peu kerane rangkanggeu cide Israelme keheime dade ngaulu, penui hangge de peu pecu rangkanggeu shekel riakngei peu. Cine Assyria gwangpei cailigwangdi nah hangdeu cika bam tadi. <verse eid="2KI 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 15:21" />Menahem tei kegwang kedadung, nah pa tei kedi leune, Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 15:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 15:22" />Cine Menahem pe paume nzwa tsaidi, nah Pekahiah pe napei pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 15:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Pekahiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 15:23" />Judah gwangpei Azariah hegwang tei kelu mmi riakngei bekum, Pekahiah Menahem napei Israel reu Samaria ga hegwang teilu; pa mmi kena hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 15:24" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Pa Nebat napei Jeroboam Israelme de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de pütdi ma. <verse eid="2KI 15:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 15:25" />Pekahiah da kedime ge Remaliah napei pezi Pekah bam, cipaude heciemtei eh pecu ketang. Gilead gade mina riakngei de ngngwalwe, Pekah ne Pekahiah, Argob nah Arieh de Samaria ga, hegwangki kuda gade teitset di. Pekah Pekahiah de teitset di delwe pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 15:26" />Pekahiah tei kegai kedadung, pa tei kedi leune, Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala.<verse eid="2KI 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei Pekah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 15:27" />Judah gwangpei Azariah hegwang tei kelu mmi riakngeiekena bekum, Remaliah napei Pekah Israel reu Samaria ga hegwang teilu; pa mmi ngkai hegwangtei. <verse eid="2KI 15:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 15:28" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Pa Nebat napei Jeroboam, Israel de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe maudung de gidi ma. <verse eid="2KI 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 15:29" />Israel gwangpei Pekah hegwang ketei ting dau, Tiglath-Pileser Assyria gwangpei gwang nah Ijon, Abel Beth Maacah, Janoah, Kedesh, Hazor, Gilead, Galilee, nah Naphtali deu pelane tuilu. Pa Assyria gage minadung de ngngwa tetgaidi. <verse eid="2KI 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 15:30" />Cine Hoshea Elah napei Remaliah napei Pekah de mmau eh heciem riemlu. Pa pecu gwaketang nah pecu teitsetdi. Pecai pa pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu, Uzziah napei Jotham hegwangtei kelu mmi ngkai bekum. <verse eid="2KI 15:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 15:31" />Pekah ha keda teikedidung, pa tei kegai leune, cidungde Israel gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala.<verse eid="2KI 15:31" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Jotham</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 15:32" />Remaliah napei Pekah, Israel gwangpei, hegwang tei kelu mmi kena bekum, Azariah napei Jotham, Judah gwangpei hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 15:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 15:33" />Pa hegwang tei kelu dau pa mmi ngkaiemengei di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieherok hegwangtei. Pe pui zi cai Jerushah; pa cai Zadok napui. <verse eid="2KI 15:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 15:34" />Jotham RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. Pa pe pei Azariah tei kegai leune puisau de nzuidi. <verse eid="2KI 15:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 15:35" />Ciuliede, nlumkemakme reca nidung au keugi dima. Minadung cu kecang de kereca nidung gage ratak teigai nah kehengui rugai. Jotham ne RAMPAUBE ki nreule rieki de teigai. <verse eid="2KI 15:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 15:36" />Jotham tei kegai kedadung, nah pa tei kedi leune, Judah gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 15:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 15:37" />Cipau tingdau RAMPAUBE ne Aram gwangpei Rezin, nah Remaliah napei Pekah de Judah gwaketang kera langgai. <verse eid="2KI 15:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 15:38" />Jotham pe paume nzwa tsaidi nah David namdi ga pe paume de kekung gage kungdi. Pecai pe napei Ahaz, pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 15:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="2KI 16" />
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Ahaz</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 16:1" />Remaliah napei Pekah hegwang teikelu mmi kereiehena bekum, Jotham napei Ahaz Judah gwangpei, hegwang tei mdeulu. <verse eid="2KI 16:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 16:2" />Ahaz mmi ngkai dige, pa hegwang teilu nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieherok hegwang tei. Pa pe pau David teikelu nzwa ma, dede pe Tinggwang RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi. <verse eid="2KI 16:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 16:3" />Meliene, pa Israel gwangpeidung lampui ga tetdi; heleuh keda tei kela kemneu batadung de reli eh pa pe napei de keru ratak tei gaibeu, RAMPAUBE Israelme dwa gade gwagi kedime nzwa. <verse eid="2KI 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 16:4" />Pa ratak teigai nah nlumkemak reca nidung gage kehengui rugai, hangdeutudung reuga, nah tsingbang kendiak kangdung leune ga. <verse eid="2KI 16:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 16:5" />Pecai Aram gwangpei Rezin nah Remaliah napei Pekah, Israel gwangpei, Jerusalem gwaketang kera hanglu. Penui Ahaz de tuilu, dede penui pecu ngamlu tadi. <verse eid="2KI 16:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 16:6" />Cipau tingdau, Aram gwangpei Rezin Aram ziemne Elath kezeu pwa daidi nah Judahme de Elath gade gwa mpetdi. Pecai Aramme Elath da gwang, cu kecangde penui lungh bamreu. <verse eid="2KI 16:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 16:7" />Cine Ahaz Assyria gwangpei Tiglath-Pileser dage samgwame de langgai eh ranggai, “Ih au n kilabe nah n na. Gwang eh gwaketang kebam Aram gwangpei ba gade nah Israel gwangpei ba gade keli beulo.” <verse eid="2KI 16:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 16:8" />Cine Ahaz rangkanggeu nah kecak RAMPAUBE ki gade ngau keludung de nah hegwangki mabamdung ga kebam de keulu delwe pa Assyria gwangpei de mtamapeu lang gaibeu. <verse eid="2KI 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 16:9" />Pecai Assyria gwangpei pe sam kingnei lu, nah Assyria gwangpei Damascus de ngngwa regi hang tuilu, delwe minadung de hebaang tui lwe Kir ga ngngwa miedi. Pa Aram gwangpei Rezin dede teitsetdi. <verse eid="2KI 16:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 16:10" />Hegwangpei Ahaz Assyria gwangpei Tiglath-Pileser de Damascus ga mie redau. Pa Damascus ga recabam ngaulu. Pa cingkupei Uriah de recabam rehi cide kesiakke langgai. <verse eid="2KI 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 16:11" />Cine cingkupei Uriah Hegwangpei Ahaz riem kegai de nzwa recabam teilu, Damascus gade lang kegaide kesiakke. Hegwangpei Ahaz Damascus gade cailigwang kemak dwa pa teicang lu. <verse eid="2KI 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 16:12" />Hegwangpei Damascus gade luge, pa recabam ngaulu eh recabam ga gwanglwe ratak teigai. <verse eid="2KI 16:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 16:13" />Pa keru recadung nah mei recadung nah zau reca ruigai nah recabam gage pe kekangbau recadung jai kezingai. <verse eid="2KI 16:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 16:14" />RAMPAUBE dwa ga kebam hetageu recabam, pa kerecaki dwa gade teugwang, pe recabam nah RAMPAUBE kerecaki kakga nah cide pe recabam tingpeule ge kailu. <verse eid="2KI 16:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 16:15" />Pecai Hegwangpei Ahaz cingkupei Uriah de aja kai eh ranggai, “Recabam kedi gage tingcang keru reca nah tinghegi mei reca teigailu, nah hegwangpei keru ratak nah pe mei reca tei gailu, nah mina pelane deu keru ratak nah penui gu mei reca nah penui zau recadung tei gailu. Cikage keru ratak jai pelane rui gailu, nah ratak jai pelane de. Dede hetageu recabam de a ziemne kai zeu luzie.” <verse eid="2KI 16:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 16:16" />Hegwangpei Ahaz ajah kai kebeu de nzwa cingkupei Uriah teilu. <verse eid="2KI 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 16:17" />Pecai Hegwangpei Ahaz kehekieng pakdung nah duikwakdung keugwang keumie lu kela bamdung reu gade keu mpetdi; pa jaaidi de hetageu tumseu le ketei pekang ga kebam reu gade pwa ngkei tangtsu tsubam reu gage kaidi. <verse eid="2KI 16:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 16:18" />Assyria gwangpei ziemne RAMPAUBE kerecaki hegwale hegwangpei nlüt de si eh, penui kerecaki tei kelu de pa Sabbath ziemne lampui tet kahgwang kecu de keu mpetdi. <verse eid="2KI 16:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 16:19" />Ahaz tei kegai kedadung nah pa tei kedi leune, cidungde Judah gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwala. <verse eid="2KI 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 16:20" />Ahaz pe paume de nzwa tsaidi nah pe paumedung de ngngwa David namdi gage kungdi. Pe napei Hezekiah pebam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 16:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="2KI 17" />
  <para style="s">Israel Gwangpei kamtube Hoshea</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 17:1" />Judah Gwangpei Ahaz hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiekena bekum, Elah napei Hoshea hegwang tei mdeulu. Pa Samaria ga Israelme reu mmi hekui ge hegwang tei. <verse eid="2KI 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 17:2" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemau teidi, dede pedwa Israel gwangdung tei kegwang mau kieege tei dima. <verse eid="2KI 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 17:3" />Assyria gwangpei Shalmaneser pecu gwaketang, nah Hoshea pe kila tei, nah heraha pecu pwapeudi. <verse eid="2KI 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 17:4" />Ge Assyria gwangpei Hoshea heciem kesia riam kebam cilu, kedanemene Hoshea Egypt gwangpei So dage samgwame de langgai; nah pa Assyria gwangpei de heraha mmi ramsang peu kela nzwa de peu tadi. Cine Assyria gwangpei pecu tuilwe hebaangki gage baangdi. <verse eid="2KI 17:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 17:5" />Pecai Assyria gwangpei hangdeu pelane gwaketang eh Samaria gwaketang nah mmi kecum ge cide twagwa pwa bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 17:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 17:6" />Hoshea hegwang tei kelu mmi hekui bekum, Assyria gwangpei Samaria tuilu nah Israelme de Assyria ga nimteu gwangdi. Pa penuide Halah, Gozan ga Habor Reuki, nah Medes namdidung gage kaidi.<verse eid="2KI 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kemau Ziemne Israel Mibaangketei</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 17:7" />Kedanemene Israelme RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang, penuide Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh ba gade nah Egypt deu gade ngngwampet kebeube dage kemau teigai kedine, penui mibaang teidi. Penui hera keda dungde recadi, <verse eid="2KI 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 17:8" />nah RAMPAUBE ne Israelme dwade gwagi kedi leuhdung zai mzui, nah Israel gwangpeidung ne hezai tei kebeudung nzuidi. <verse eid="2KI 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 17:9" />Israelmedung ngkim eh, RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang, dwa de petau kemakbedung teidi. Penui ziemne penui nlumkemak reca nidung penui namdi leune ga, reketbam gade riekelu namdi ga kecang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 17:10" />Hangdeutu kehu leune gage nah tsingbang kemdiak leune kangga penui tsusumdung nah Asherah miedung sum silu. <verse eid="2KI 17:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 17:11" />RAMPAUBE penui dwa gade gwagi kedi leuhdung zai mzui eh penui nlumkemak reca nidung leu gage kehengui rugai. Israelme kemau tadung tei eh RAMPAUBE rata teidi; <verse eid="2KI 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 17:12" />penui mamiedung de recadi, RAMPAUBE penui dage, “Nnui ma aidungde tei lak,” de eh rang liede. <verse eid="2KI 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 17:13" />Dede RAMPAUBE ndugai, Israel penai Judah dage peu pe samgwame leune nah caihakecime leu dage, rang eh, “Nnui kemau lampui gade nreulu nah aja nah hezaidung Ih kai kebeu de mzailu, nah Ih nnui paume nah Ih a kilame caihakecime dade nnui dage kaikebeu hezaidung pelane mzai sünne lulo.” <verse eid="2KI 17:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 17:14" />Dede penui kingnei tadi, meliene penui lung hung zudi eh penui peimedung RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang de nlumlu kemakme nzwadi. <verse eid="2KI 17:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 17:15" />Penui pezaidung nah pa penui paume de ngngwa samkak keludungde, nah samkak kelu hezaidung pa penuide kepeudung mzai raudi. Penui kemta miedung caisuidi nah penui penuikatei kemtame teidi. Penuide twagwa pung kebam mamie de reca kela leuhdung zai, RAMPAUBE reli helo penuide aja kaibeu liede penui suidi. <verse eid="2KI 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 17:16" />Penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang sam kaikebeu pelane gikahdi. Penui reca kera hegeu tumseu rehi kena teilu. Penui Asherah mie gede teilu, nah penui tinggim ga hegidung pelane nah Baal de recadi. <verse eid="2KI 17:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 17:17" />Penui penui napeidung nah napuidung de pwa keru ratak teigai, penui rekame nah kehemeu dung sui keteudi, penui RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade kemaube gage penui ting ngngwangdi, nah penui pe rata teidi. <verse eid="2KI 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 17:18" />Ciziemne RAMPAUBE Israelme de pe rata sütti nah pe miakdwa gade penuide keu gidi. Judahme leuhme gwale migede bam si tadi.<verse eid="2KI 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 17:19" />Judah kecang de RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang ajadung mzailu tadi, nah penui Israel tei kela caisui teidi. <verse eid="2KI 17:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 17:20" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israel leuh pelane de pütti; pa penuide keherei peu nah penui ngauraume ba gage kaidi, pa pe miakdwa gade penuide gwa gidi kemaktane. <verse eid="2KI 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 17:21" />Pa David kedi ria gade Israel de teu pangdi, nah penui Nebat napei Jeroboam de peu hegwang teilu. Jeroboam Israel de peu RAMPAUBE caisui tei melu kerane teu ntsamdi, nah penuide peu kemau kedi teidi. <verse eid="2KI 17:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 17:22" />Israel leuhme Jeroboam kemau ta leune nzuidi, nah penui cidungde gade mpet ntsamlu tadi. <verse eid="2KI 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 17:23" />Cine RAMPAUBE Israel de pe dwa gade gwa gidi, pa pe kilame caihakecimedung dage pa teizie lie kerang nzwa eh. Cine Israel de penuikatei penui deu gade langgi pwa Assyria gage kaidi, nah cu kecang de ainzwa cika lunghla.<verse eid="2KI 17:23" /></para>
  <para style="s">Samaria ha Lunghdaikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 17:24" />Assyria gwangpei Babylon, Kuthah, Avva, Hamath nah Sepharvaim gade mina de ngngwa gwanglu, nah Israelme langgai kedime nding gade penuide peu Samaria namdidung lunghlu. Penui Samaria gumlu nah namdidung ga lungdi. <verse eid="2KI 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 17:25" />Penui cika lungh mdeu keludau penui RAMPAUBE de reca tadi. Cine RAMPAUBE hinghodung penui kakga ge langgai eh kangge de teitsetdi. <verse eid="2KI 17:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 17:26" />Cine penui Assyria gwangpei dage ranggai, “Nang heleuhdung de peu gwang Samaria namdidung ga lungh kedimedung Tinggwang lukeneu zaidung de ci ma. Cine pa hinghodung de penui kakgage langgai, nah ainie, hinghodung minadung de teitset bam dida, kedanemene penui cipau deu ga Tinggwang luukeneu zaidung ci kemakne.”<verse eid="2KI 17:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 17:27" />Cine Assyria gwangpei aja kai eh ranggai, “Nnui cikade ngngwa gwang kelu cingkume gede ngngwa gwanglu, delwe pecu peu mie cika lunghlu, iciu eh pecu peu penuide cipau deu ga Tinggwang luukeneu zaidung minadung dage ledeu beulu.” <verse eid="2KI 17:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 17:28" />Cine penui Samaria gade langgi kedi cingkume gede peu gwang eh Bethel ga lunghlu; pa penuide dainzwa RAMPAUBE de reca labi ledeubeu. <verse eid="2KI 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 17:29" />Heleuh ketsamtsam penuikatei penui gu rabe mie riep teilu, nah cidungde Samariame ne tei kelu nlumkemakme reca nidung gage kailu, heleuh ketsamtsam leune penui lungh kebam namdidung gage kailu. <verse eid="2KI 17:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 17:30" />Babylonme Succoth Benoth rabe mie teilu; Kuthahme ne Nergal rabe mie teilu; Hamathme Ashima rabe mie teilu. <verse eid="2KI 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 17:31" />Avvime Nibhaz nah Tartak rabe mie teilu. Sepharvame penui name de mi gage keru ratak tei pwa Sepharvame rabe Adrammelek nah Anammelek de peu. <verse eid="2KI 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 17:32" />Penui RAMPAUBE de herüt peu, nah penuikatei penui kakgade kerecadung ga cingkume tei kera kedetlu, mina aidungde penui ziemne kereca nidung kerecakidung ga ratak teibeu. <verse eid="2KI 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 17:33" />Penui RAMPAUBE de herüt peu, nah penui rabe dede reca, heleuhdung kakgade penui langgi kedimedung zai mzaidi.<verse eid="2KI 17:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 17:34" />Henai kecangde penui penui zaidung kehegwa de ga tetla. Penui RAMPAUBE de herüt peu ma, mede penui hezaidung, aja, mede RAMPAUBE, pa Jacob leuhme de peu Israel zielie de msiak kebeube aja kai kebeudungde mzai ma. <verse eid="2KI 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 17:35" />Kedanemene RAMPAUBE penuide ngngwa samkakkelu ge teilu delwe aja kaigai, “Nnui hera kedadungde reca so, mede nnui penui da keumie so, mede penui gwatei so, mede penui dage ratak teigai so. <verse eid="2KI 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 17:36" />Dede RAMPAUBE, Egypt deu gade kengking nah pumchi kedi teu eh, nnuide ngngwa mpet kebeube de nnui herüt peu maisia, nnui pe dage keumie zie nah nnui pe dage ratak teigai zie. <verse eid="2KI 17:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 17:37" />Pa hezaidung pelane nah ajadung nnui ziemne rau kebeudung, nnui cidungde kelungta mzai zie. Cine nnui hera kedadung de reca so, <verse eid="2KI 17:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="2KI 17:38" />nah Ih nnuide ngngwa samkak kelude, nnui nsungta lak; mede hera kedadungde nnui herüt peulak. <verse eid="2KI 17:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="2KI 17:39" />Dede RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang de nnui herüt peu maisia. Pa nnui ngauraume kengking gade nnuide keli beuzie.” <verse eid="2KI 17:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="2KI 17:40" />Penui kingnei tadi, kedanemene penui ndaa tei kelabe tei jüja la kedine. <verse eid="2KI 17:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="2KI 17:41" />Cine heleuh aidungde RAMPAUBE mie hinglu, nah penui ne tei kelu miedung de de penui recadi, nah penui name de nah, penui tsamedung de cinzwa teigwang. Henai kecang de penui paume tei kelade penui tei jüja ladi.<verse eid="2KI 17:41" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="2KI 18" />
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Hezekiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 18:1" />Cu Israel gwangpei Elah napei Hoshea hegwang teikelu mmi kecum bekum, Judah gwangpei Ahaz napei Hezekiah hegwang tei cuhdi. <verse eid="2KI 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 18:2" />Pa mmi ngkaiemengei dige pa hegwang teilu, pa Jerusalem ga mmi ngkaiehekui hegwang tei. Pepui zi cai Abijah, pa au Zechariah napui. <verse eid="2KI 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 18:3" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakdwa gade petaube teilu, pe pau David tei kegai puisau mzuilu. <verse eid="2KI 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 18:4" />Pa nlumkemakme reca nidung keu gidi, tsusumdung tei pangdi, nah Asherah miedung bi ngkaudi. Pa Moses ne hetageu le henei teikelu, Nehushtan lie qu kela de teipang takcaidi, kedanemene Israelme cipau tingdau cide de kehengui rugai kelane. <verse eid="2KI 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 18:5" />Hezekiah RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang de nlumlu, cine pecai Judah hegwangmedung kakga, mede pedwale hegwang tei gwang kedidung kakgade migede pa kenzwa gah. <verse eid="2KI 18:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 18:6" />Kedanemene pa RAMPAUBE dade masanglu. Pa pecai sui mtak dima, dede RAMPAUBE ne Moses dage aja kai kebeu zaidung mzailu. <verse eid="2KI 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 18:7" />Cine RAMPAUBE Hezekiah de ngngwala, nah keheiga pa miede pa ngkienglu. Pa Assyria gwangpei de reniadi nah pekang nlüt ma. <verse eid="2KI 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 18:8" />Pa Philistin gade Gaza nah pe deurai kecang, nah reketbam gade riekelu namdi kecang gwaketang.<verse eid="2KI 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 18:9" />Hezekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi mdai bekum de, cide Elah napei Hoshea Israel gwangpei hegwang tei kelu mmi hena bekum, Assyria gwangpei Shalmaneser Samaria de gwalüt eh cide twagwalu. <verse eid="2KI 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 18:10" />Mmi kecum kekamle dau penui cide gwalu, cide Hezekiah hegwang teikelu mmi herok bekum, nah Israel gwangpei Hoshea hegwang teikelu mmi hekui bekum; ainzwa eh Samaria tuilu. <verse eid="2KI 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 18:11" />Cine Assyria gwangpei Israel de nimteu Assyria ga gwangdi, delwe penuide Halah, nah Gozan ga Habor Reuki gage, nah Medes namdidung gage kaidi. <verse eid="2KI 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 18:12" />Pa aide tei gai, kedanemene penui RAMPAUBE penui Tinggwang zai mnei ta kedine, dede penui RAMPAUBE kilabe Moses ne kepeu ajadung nah samkakkelu zaidung de gikah kedine. Penui kingnei ma nah tei raudi.<verse eid="2KI 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 18:13" />Pecai Hegwangpei Hezekiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereiemdai bekum, Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib, Judah ga riekelu namdi pelane de gwalüt eh cidungde gumlu. <verse eid="2KI 18:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 18:14" />Cine Judah gwangpei Hezekiah Lachish ga kebam Assyria gwangpei dage sam langgai eh, ranggai, “Ih nda ge tei mau dida. A dade caili lu. Nang keheibe acu mpüt gai kebeube Ih pung luzie.” Assyria gwangpei Judah gwangpei Hezekiah dage rangkang geu talent haicum nah kecak talent camrei peulo kiegai. <verse eid="2KI 18:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 18:15" />Cine Hezekiah pecu RAMPAUBE ki nah hegwangki mabam ga kebam rangkang geu pelane peudi. <verse eid="2KI 18:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 18:16" />Ge Hezekiah RAMPAUBE kerecaki kikamdung gade, nah pa kikamtsiadung gade kemaipwa kebam kecak de tei mpetlu delwe Assyria gwangpei kecak peudi.<verse eid="2KI 18:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sennacherib Jerusalem de keheukecu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 18:17" />Dede Assyria gwangpei pe reugwa kekie ge de ngngwa hekwalu, Tartan nah Rabsaris nah reugwamuibe kedibe de si eh Lachish gade Jerusalem gwangpei Hezekiah da langgai. Penui beuh lampuidung tet gwang nah Jerusalem hegwale ga gwang canglu. Penui rejaai nreube gade reuna duilwa kebam paiketame luh lampui taiga gwang saplu. <verse eid="2KI 18:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 18:18" />Penui Hezekiah gwangpei de qu kegai dau, Hilkiah napei Eliakim, hegwangki pie kerengeibe, nah keraube Shebna, nah Asaph napei Joah kerauta dung kerengeibe, penuide redau kera tetpetlu.<verse eid="2KI 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 18:19" />Cine reugwamuibe ditube penui dage sam aide Hezekiah dage ranggai beulo beu, Hegwang kedibe, Assyria gwangpei ainzwa rangzeu: “Daiziemne nang n mlung dilau eh bamno? <verse eid="2KI 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 18:20" />Nang kemta samdung rünne rangla, ncu ngha kerame nah hereu tei kera kengkieng bamlie rangkebam. Nang caude nlum bamno, nang acu ngngwa renia kera? <verse eid="2KI 18:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 18:21" />Ainie, nang Egypt hekuubangle teu hetuitie teikelu aide de nlum bam, dede mige cika ngngei gai eh pang dicai, peba kam dizie. Cide nzwa Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh au pecu nlum kela keheibe dage tei gaila. <verse eid="2KI 18:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 18:22" />Dede nang adage, ‘Anui RAMPAUBE anui Tinggwang de nlum bam,’ de eh rang lubui; dede Hezekiah nlumkemak reca nidung nah recabamdung tei msaidi meni nah pa Judah dage nah Jerusalem dage, ‘Nnui Jerusalem ga aipau recabam dwa gade recalu maisia’ de eh rang meni? <verse eid="2KI 18:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 18:23" />Ciziemne cu Ih, ncu peu litak keyi ge a mpaube Assyria gwangpei de ngngwa tei neu bam. Ih ncu hekwen cangna peu zie, magade nang cidungde teu kerame ngau lubui cai. <verse eid="2KI 18:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 18:24" />Dainzwa nang kedibe a mpaube kilame de mneitube dede canglu lai? Nang Egyptme bagidung nah hekwen keteume dage n kenlum kai dida! <verse eid="2KI 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 18:25" />Ih heni aide de regi nah ngkapti kera RAMPAUBE si mene aika mbeuh hang lie bam ni? RAMPAUBE adage rangbeu, ‘Hangdeu aide gwaketanglu nah ngkapdi lo.’”<verse eid="2KI 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 18:26" />Pecai Hilkiah napei Eliakim, nah Shebnah, nah Joah reugwamuibe ditube dage rangdi, kehereide n kilame dade Aramaic let gade rang lulo, kedanemene anui cide cibam. Anuide Judahme let gade rang so kirie reuga kebamme kingnei bamlu. <verse eid="2KI 18:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 18:27" />Dede reugwamui ditube penui dage rangdi, “A mpaube acu nnui mpaube nah nnui dage sam aidungde rang kera langgai ni? Pa acu kirie reuga bam kebamme ziemne de si eh langgai me ni, penuide penuikatei penui teu tyei zie nah penuikatei penui zung sak zie nnui de ngngwalwe?” <verse eid="2KI 18:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 18:28" />Pecai reugwamui ditube cu saplwe sahbak eh Jewme let gade ranggai, hegwang kedibe Assyria gwangpei sam kingnei lulo. <verse eid="2KI 18:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 18:29" />Hegwangpei rangzeu, ‘Peu Hezekiah de nnuide cwa diso, kedanemene pa nnuide a kengkieng gade keli gai laklu. <verse eid="2KI 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 18:30" />Hezekiah sam ziemne nnui RAMPAUBE de nlum so, pa, “RAMPAUBE anuide kelibeu bi zie, nah namdi aide Assyria gwangpei ba gage kai dilak,”’ de eh kerang ziemne. <verse eid="2KI 18:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 18:31" />Hezekiah kwa kingnei so, kedanemene Assyria gwangpei ainzwa rangzeu: ‘Acu ngngwa kezuyi lu, nah ada gwanglu. Iciu lucai nnui pelane de pekatei pe kubetsibang gade tyei zie, nah pekatei pe tangzüttsibang gade, nah pekatei pe tekwa gade dui sakzie. <verse eid="2KI 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 18:32" />Ih gwang eh nnuide hangdeu ge nnui katei nnui deu kenzwa ge ga ngngwa tet gai kemaktane nnui aide teibam zie. Cipau deude au, ketyei kesak nah zau keheci, tangku nah kubetsi kebam deu ge, olive bangdung nah heliadui kebam deu ge. Iciu eh nnui ring luzie nah tsai dilak.’ “Hezekiah nnuide kemeu kera tei eh ‘RAMPAUBE ne anuide kelibeu zie’ de eh kerang dau pekwa kingnei so. <verse eid="2KI 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 18:33" />Heleuh keda rabedung gede penuide Assyria gwangpei ba gade kelilu dini? <verse eid="2KI 18:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 18:34" />Hamath nah Arpad rabedung dai ga lano? Sepharvaim, hena, nah Ivvah rabedung daiga lano? Penui a ba gade Samaria kelilu dini? <verse eid="2KI 18:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 18:35" />Heleuhdung rabedung pelane kakde, rabe kette pe deu a kengkieng kang gade kelilu kera bam ni? Dainzwa RAMPAUBE Jerusalem kelibeu zie no a kengkieng kang gade?”<verse eid="2KI 18:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 18:36" />Dede minadung zingde di nah sam gede keli tadi, kedanemene Hegwangpei aja kai gaibeu, “Pesam keli so,” de eh. <verse eid="2KI 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 18:37" />Pecai Hilkiah napei Eliakim, hegwangki pie kerengeibe, keraube Shebna, nah Asaph napei Joah kerau tadung kerengeibe, penui paini hiet ti eh Hezekiah da gwang nah pe dage reugwamui ditube samdung de pau liabeu.<verse eid="2KI 18:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="2KI 19" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem Lungmpetlu Kera Mrairangkebeu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 19:1" />Hegwangpei Hezekiah penui pau kegai sam siu luge, pa pe paini hietti, roso pai bahlu, delwe RAMPAUBE ki ga lütdi. <verse eid="2KI 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 19:2" />Pa Eliakim hegwangki pie kerengei be, nah keraube Shebna, nah cingkume kecingmedung de lang gai, pelane roso pai bahlu eh caihakecibe Amoz napei Isaiah da gwang. <verse eid="2KI 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 19:3" />Penui pe dage rangdi, “Hezekiah ranggai, ‘Henai lungrei tingba ge, kesiu kecu nah hengam tingba ge, kedanemene mipui hena mna kera tingdau nnei ham eh mna gailak eh kebam pui nzwa dida. <verse eid="2KI 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 19:4" />Ciciu eh RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang reugwamui ditube samdung siu bam zie, pecu lang gai eh pe mpaube Assyria gwangpei ringkela Tinggwang de ncau kecu, nah RAMPAUBE nnui Tinggwang siu kebam samdung de mmau beu bi zie. Hemaa keceu aika kebamme ziemne cu nnui kie lulo.’” <verse eid="2KI 19:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 19:5" />Cine hegwangpei Hezekiah kilame Isaiah da gwang, <verse eid="2KI 19:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 19:6" />nah Isaiah penui dage rangdi, “Nnui mpaube dage rang beulo: ‘RAMPAUBE ranggai, “Nang siukelu samdung de ne ncu keheu diso, cide ne Assyria gwangpei kilamedung acu rangmsia dida. <verse eid="2KI 19:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 19:7" />Pielo, Ih rabe ge peda kaigai zie, nah pa letkiee samdung siu zie, nah pekatei pedeu ga caili gwang dizie. Ih pekatei pedeu gage pecu teitsetdi zie.”’” <verse eid="2KI 19:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 19:8" />Pecai reugwamui ditube cailigwang eh Assyria gwangpei Libnah de ngngwa keregi bam lie kecu cilu, kedanemene Lachish gade hegwangpei tetti delie kecu pa siu kelune. <verse eid="2KI 19:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 19:9" />Pecai Sennacherib pecu ngngwa keregi kerane Cush gwangpei Tirhakah nah Egypt, reugwamedung de qu hekwa kebam cide siulu, cine pa samgwame de Hezekiah da sam teugwang kera langgai dai. <verse eid="2KI 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 19:10" />“Judah gwangpei Hezekiah dage rang beulo, ‘Nang nlum kebam n Tinggwang de peu ncu cwa diso, “Jerusalem de Assyria gwangpei ba gage kai dilak,” de rang eh. <verse eid="2KI 19:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 19:11" />Ainie, nang Assyria gwangpeime hangdeudung pelane ga penuide tei ngkap cangsiak eh dai teigai bi ci nah ngau bam. Ncu daitei kelibeu lai? <verse eid="2KI 19:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 19:12" />Gozan, Haran, Rezeph, nah Eden minadung Tel Assar ga kelunghme: A paume ne ngkap kedi heleuhdung, heleuhdung rabedung penuide kelibeu ni? <verse eid="2KI 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 19:13" />Hamath gwangpei, Arpad gwangpei, Sepharvaim namdidung gwangpei, Hena, nah Ivvah gwangpeidung dai ga bam no?’”<verse eid="2KI 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Kekie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 19:14" />Hezekiah samgwame dade laisiu aide ngau lwe peilu. Pecai pa RAMPAUBE ki ga nghang lwe pedwa gage kai gailu. <verse eid="2KI 19:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 19:15" />Pecai Hezekiah RAMPAUBE dwa gade kekie tei nah rangdi “Reugwame reu RAMPAUBO, Israel Tinggwang, nang Cherubim reu kebambe, nang rünne Tinggwang kideu ga hegwangram pelane reu. Nang tinggimdung nah kideu damgai. <verse eid="2KI 19:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 19:16" />RAMPAUBO, n kwen nreugwang nah kingnei lulo. RAMPAUBO, n miak ngkei gai eh pie gailo, nah Sennacherib lang kegai samdung de, pa ring kela Tinggwang sam teu henui ketei kingnei gailo. <verse eid="2KI 19:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 19:17" />RAMPAUBO, Assyria gwangpei heleuhdung nah penui deudung ngkap kesang dida. <verse eid="2KI 19:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 19:18" />Penui rabedung de penui mi gage ru dida, kedanemene cide rabedung ma, dede tsing nah tangtsu mina bane teikelu ge. Cine Assyriame cidungde tei msiadi. <verse eid="2KI 19:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 19:19" />Ciucai cu, RAMPAUBO anui Tinggwang, Ih nda de kiela, anuide pe kengkieng gade keli beulo, ciciude kideu ga hegwangram pelane nang rünne, RAMPAUBE, Tinggwang lie kecu ci luzie.”<verse eid="2KI 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Sennacherib Kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 19:20" />Pecai Amoz napei Isaiah samli ge Hezekiah dage langgai eh ranggai, “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang rang zeu, ‘Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib n dage lungrei kekai de ziemne nang ada de kie kegai Ih siu luda. <verse eid="2KI 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 19:21" />Aide RAMPAUBE ne pe ha rang kegai sam delie:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:21">“Zion relei kemci napuime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">ncu mlai nah ncu nui eh henui teibam.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:21">Jerusalem napuime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:21">nda ge pe peu peungum bam.<verse eid="2KI 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 19:22" />Caude nang kii nah mneula no?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Caude nang ncau eh n kwa hugai no</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:22">nah helia eh n miak pie hu di dino?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:22">Cide au Israel kemcibe.<verse eid="2KI 19:22" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 19:23" />N samgwamedung de ngngwa</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nang Rampaube de ncau,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:23">eh rangdi,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">a bagidung peikap gai kelak teu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:23">Ih lamlwatu kehudung ga hang,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nah Lebanon deutu hutubedung ga.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:23">Ih cedar bang kehudung</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">nah cypress bang yitubedung cika kebam bi dizie.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:23">Ih hegung cuktu ga lüt zie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:23">mania keyi builu kela hegung ga.<verse eid="2KI 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 19:24" />Ih tekwadung kuilu</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">nah sangme duidung saklu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:24">Ih Egypt reukidung pelane</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:24">a pideu le dau cangh dida.’<verse eid="2KI 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 19:25" />Nang siu meni Ih aide ndaade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">riempwa la dida,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:25">nah ndaa ge teicang dida?</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">Ih cu ncu peu kera pwagwang.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:25">Nang namdidung heni aika ngngwa gwangla teimsia bang kebam kidung ga mina kekiee lungh kebam</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:25">tsukwa teimeu lüt eh.<verse eid="2KI 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 19:26" />Mina cika kelunghme mnei,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">penuide teupang nah hengam teidi.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:26">Penui luh ga</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">cehei kemdiak,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:26">luh ga mede kireu ga cehei lungh kebam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:26">cide bwa cuhlu kemakne rudi.<verse eid="2KI 19:26" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 19:27" />Dede Ih nang kebam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">nang kegwang kemie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:27">nah acu mmau eh n rata kebam cibam.<verse eid="2KI 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 19:28" />Acu mmau eh n rata bam,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">nah n hegie samdung a kwen ga gwang kedine,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:28">Ih n nkie gage kegwak ge kaizie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">nah n mui gage kekangria ge kai dizie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:28">Ih nang kegwang lampui gade</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:28">ncu peu tet caili dai dizie.”<verse eid="2KI 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 19:29" />Aide n ziemne ma rehi ge zie:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">Hekum nang renaam gade kelungh tyei zie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">nah nkikum nang cika de daipai bwa mi.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">Dede pecai bekum au nang nleuh ling maisia nah luhlüt lubui,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:29">nah kubebang linglu eh kubetsi tyei zie.<verse eid="2KI 19:29" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 19:30" />Bangkelu Judah ga lungh kebamme kangge</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:30">pe mah him dailu eh petsi bui luzie.<verse eid="2KI 19:30" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 19:31" />Kedanemene Jerusalem gade bang kelume lungh pet zie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:31">Nah Zion deutu gade de kelikelume gwang zie. Aide Reugwame reu RAMPAUBE tei kera lungning de ne teilu zie. <verse eid="2KI 19:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 19:32" />Cine RAMPAUBE Assyria gwangpei ha aide rang gaila:</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:32">“Pa namdi aika lütlak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">Mede cide gage lakpitsi gede kapgai lak.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2KI 19:32">Mede pa cide dwa hegeu punglwe gwang gailak</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:32">Mede kekwa mbaiki gede tei gailak.<verse eid="2KI 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 19:33" />Pa kegwang lampui de gade</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">pa tet caili dai cu nzwa dizie;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:33">pa namdi aika lüt lak</para>
  <para style="q3" vid="2KI 19:33">aide RAMPAUBE ndu kegai da.”<verse eid="2KI 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 19:34" />Kedanemene Ih namdi aide kwa nah gum luzie,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="2KI 19:34">a ziemne nah a kilabe David ziemne.’”<verse eid="2KI 19:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 19:35" />Cipau ziu RAMPAUBE gwame ge mie delwe Assyriame ramzeuki gwaketang eh reugwame 185,000 de teitsetdi. Tingcang nuge minadung cuh luge, ketsai paaule kehei leuga puidi. <verse eid="2KI 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 19:36" />Cine Assyria gwangpei Sennacherib Israel gade tetti nah kilung cailigwang eh Nineveh ga bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 19:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 19:37" />Pecai, pa pe rabe Nisrok de ki gade reca kebamdau, pe napei kena Adrammelek nah Sharezer ne kiengtie le pecu teitsetdi. Ge penai Ararat deu gage pak gaidi. Iciu eh pe napei Esarhaddon pe bam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 19:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="2KI 20" />
  <para style="s">Hezekiah Mateeikedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 20:1" />Cipau tingdau Hezekiah mra eh tsaidi laidi. Cine caihakecibe Amoz napei Isaiah peda gwang, nah pe dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE rang zeu, ‘N kilung lamlui teune lulo; kedanemene nang ringgai lakta nah tsai dizie da.’” <verse eid="2KI 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 20:2" />Cidau Hezekiah linggule pezu pung nreugwang delwe RAMPAUBE dade kekie tei eh, ranggai, <verse eid="2KI 20:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 20:3" />Ge Hezekiah hap mteisüt eh cu, “Ngaunggia eh nsung gailo, RAMPAUBO, Ih n dwa gade a mlung pelane teu masang eh tet gwang kecu, nah n miakngau gade dai yi labi Ih tei kegwang tei delu.” <verse eid="2KI 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 20:4" />Isaiah hegwangki sum ga tetkah di kemak dwa, RAMPAUBE sam ge pe dage gwang eh, ranggai, <verse eid="2KI 20:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 20:5" />“A gu mina muiteube Hezekiah da caili lüt eh rang beulo, ‘Aide RAMPAUBE n pau David Tinggwang ne rang lie eh: “Ih n kekie siu luda, nah n miakdui ngau luda. Ih n mateei langcumne benai tei hemi beuzie, nah nang RAMPAUBE ki ga hang luzie. <verse eid="2KI 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 20:6" />Ih n teilungh mmi kereiehmengei peu si zie, nah Ih ncu nah namdi aide Assyria gwangpei ba gade kelibeu zie, nah Ih namdi aide gum luzie akatei a ziemne nah a kilabe David ziemne.”’” <verse eid="2KI 20:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 20:7" />Cine Isaiah rangdi, “Tangzüttsi le tei kelu kangge keulu.” Ge penui kerang nzwa tei eh cide reteei zam gage kaigai, nah pa yilu.<verse eid="2KI 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 20:8" />Hezekiah Isaiah dage rangdi, “Daipai rehi ge zie no RAMPAUBE a mateei tei hemi beu kera, nah Ih RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga langcumne benai hang kera de?” <verse eid="2KI 20:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 20:9" />Isaiah keli eh, “RAMPAUBE dade n ziemne ma rehi aide zie, cide RAMPAUBE pa rang kedi be teicang zie. Peu tingkaumie de pikiet kerei tetpet ziemi, mi pikiet kerei tet caisim zie no?” <verse eid="2KI 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 20:10" />Hezekiah keli eh cu, “Tingkaumie ziemne pikiet kerei tetpet kecube au la zie. Peu tingkaumie de pikiet kerei tet caisim dilu.” <verse eid="2KI 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 20:11" />Cine caihakecibe Isaiah RAMPAUBE dage mra gai, ge pa tingkaumie de peu Ahaz ne teipwa kebam, takswa de gade pikiet kerei keu caisinlu.<verse eid="2KI 20:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Babylon gade Mina Kegwang</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 20:12" />Cipau tingdau Baladan napei Babylon gwangpei Marduk-Baladan Hezekiah mateei kebam ha siulu, cine pa Hezekiah de laisiudung nah mtamapeu ge lang gaibeu. <verse eid="2KI 20:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 20:13" />Hezekiah laisiu cidungde ga rau kenzeudung pei kegai kingnei siakte lu, nah ciciu eh samgwamedung de pe hegwangki nah pe mabam pemi kewhungdung pelane, rangkanggeu, kecak, mosala, nah maca pemi kewhung, nah pe reugwanet kekai kidung, nah mabam kekai kidung ga kebam pelane keu liagai. Pe hegwangki, mede pe hegwangram ga kebamdung magede Hezekiah penuide keu lia kemak gah. <verse eid="2KI 20:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 20:14" />Pecai caihakecibe Isaiah Hegwangpei Hezekiah da gwang nah peda keteu, “Mina aidungde n dage daipai rang no? Dai gade penui gwang la no?” Hezekiah rangdi, “Penui mdei süt kecu Babylon deudi gade gwangla,” de beu. <verse eid="2KI 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 20:15" />Isaiah keteu gai, “Daipai penui n ki gade pie no?” Hezekiah keli eh cu, “Penui a ki gade ma pelane pie luda. Agu ma pemi kewhung niadung kakgade Ih keulia kemak magede gah da.”<verse eid="2KI 20:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 20:16" />Cine Isaiah Hezekiah dage rangdi, “RAMPAUBE sam kingnei lulo: <verse eid="2KI 20:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 20:17" />‘Pielo, n hegwangki ga maleune, n paume henai kecang hekwa kelu leune, Babylon gage pung gaidi kera tingbadung ge gwang lauda. RAMPAUBE rang zeu, magede bang nzeu beulak. <verse eid="2KI 20:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 20:18" />N dade lunghkegwang mipeinadung, n teih n jai gade lungh kelumedung, penui penuide ngngwa tetti zie, nah Babylon gwangpei hegwangki ga eunuchme tei dizie.’” <verse eid="2KI 20:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 20:19" />Pecai Hezekiah Isaiah dage rangdi, “Nang rang kegai RAMPAUBE sam au yilie.” Kedanemene pa cetdi, “A teilung tingdau kezuyi nah kwak kecu bamlak deni?” <verse eid="2KI 20:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 20:20" />Hezekiah tei kegai leune, pe kengkieng pelane, nah pa duibau nah helaudung teilu dibi, nah dainzwa pa namdi ga duiria teu gwang lubi, Cidungde Judah gwangpeidung hakwak gage raupwa la meni? <verse eid="2KI 20:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 20:21" />Hezekiah pe paumedung nzwa tsaidi, nah pe napei Manasseh ne pebam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 20:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="2KI 21" />
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Manasseh</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 21:1" />Manasseh hegwangpei tei mdeu keludau pa mmi kereiekena di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi riakngeimengei hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Hephzibah. <verse eid="2KI 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 21:2" />RAMPAUBE Israelme dwa gade gwa kedi be leuhdung zai de nzui kecu nzwa, pa RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi. <verse eid="2KI 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 21:3" />Kedanemene pa nlum kemak reca nidung de Hezekiah pe pei ne tei ngkap kedi de retak dailu, nah pa Baal ziemne recabam teilu, Israel gwangpei Ahab tei kegai nzwa Asherah mie teilu, nah pa tinggim hegidung pelane da keumie eh cidungde recadi. <verse eid="2KI 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 21:4" />Manasseh RAMPAUBE ki ga recabam teilu, RAMPAUBE aja kaibeu liede, “Jerusalem ga a zi kelunghta bam zie.” <verse eid="2KI 21:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 21:5" />Pa RAMPAUBE ki ga kigu kena gage tinggim hegidung ziemne recabam teilu. <verse eid="2KI 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 21:6" />Pa pe napei de pwa keru ratak teigai, pa herarai nah reka ta tei nah ketsaime de mpaukelame nah rabe de mpau kelame dade ma keteu. Pa RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau kedi tei gaidi eh, perata teidi. <verse eid="2KI 21:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 21:7" />Pa Asherah mie heri kelude, cide pa RAMPAUBE ki gage kailu. Cipau heni ha de RAMPAUBE David nah pe napei Solomon dage ranggai; pa ainzwa rangbeu, “Ih a zi kelunghta kai dizie, aipau Jerusalem gade nah ki gade, Ih Israel leuh pelane gade kedetkelu be da. <verse eid="2KI 21:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 21:8" />Ih penuide aja kai kebeu leune penui mzai sünne lucai nah a kilabe Moses penuide aja kai kebeu hezaidung de pelane mnei lu cai, Ih penui paume de kepeu deu de gade Ih Israel de peu gwagi kecu tei lak.” <verse eid="2KI 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 21:9" />Dede minadung sam kingnei tadi, nah RAMPAUBE Israelme dwa ga tei ngkap kedi heleuhdung swade diki kecu maudung gage Manasseh penuide ngngwa gaidi. <verse eid="2KI 21:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 21:10" />Cine RAMPAUBE pe kilame caihakecime dage ranggai, <verse eid="2KI 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 21:11" />Kedanemene Judah gwangpei Manasseh ma kemneeu aidungde tei gaida, nah Amorme pe dwa ga tei kegai swa de siaki kecudung teigai, nah pe miedung de le Judah de kemau gage ngngwa gaidi <verse eid="2KI 21:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 21:12" />cine RAMPAUBE Israel Tinggwang, ainzwa rangzeu: Pielo, Ih Jerusalem nah Judah gage aikenzwa kekap ge langgai zieda, nah cide ha siu kelume de keheu dizie. <verse eid="2KI 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 21:13" />Ih Samaria de ngkap kegai nzwa ci kesiakke Jerusalem de de ngkap dizie, nah Ahab leuhme de ngkap kegai nzwa; Ih Jerusalem minadung de maimci dizie, li ge hui mci kedi nzwa, cide hui kedi nah ngkum kedi nzwa beu zie. <verse eid="2KI 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 21:14" />Ih a mapwamaleuhme bang kelume de gi dizie nah penuide penui ngauraume ba gage kai dizie. Penuide ngauraume ne ngam luzie, nah penui ngauraume leune ziemne penui au tui kelu mabam ge dizie, <verse eid="2KI 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 21:15" />kedanemene penui a miakngau gade kemau tei gaidi, nah penui paume Egypt ga mpet kelu gade henai kecang a rata tei kedine.<verse eid="2KI 21:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 21:16" />Cipaureude, Manasseh Jerusalem penli tuge lam de kedale ge ketsai le teipui di kemaktane maukemakme jai tei lwa gai. Pa aide Judah de peu kemau tei kegai gage si eh tei gai, penui RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau tei kegaidau. <verse eid="2KI 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 21:17" />Manasseh tei kegai ha kedadung, pa kemau tei kedi leune, cidungde Judah gwangpei heta ketei hakwak gage rau pwala meni? <verse eid="2KI 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 21:18" />Manasseh pe paume de ngngwa tsaidi nah pekatei pe ki gurie Uzza gurie gage kungdi. Amon pe napei pebam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 21:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Amon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 21:19" />Amon hegwang tei kelu dau pa mmi ngkaiekena di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kena hegwang tei. Pe pui zi cai Meshullemeth; pa cai Jotbah Haruz napui. <verse eid="2KI 21:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 21:20" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi, pe pei Manasseh tei kegai nzwa. <verse eid="2KI 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 21:21" />Amon pe pei tet kegai puisau leune ga nzuidi nah cidungde ga keumie eh pe pei mamie reca kela de reca di. <verse eid="2KI 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 21:22" />Pa RAMPAUBE, pe paume Tinggwang de mlai di, nah RAMPAUBE lampui ga tet ma. <verse eid="2KI 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 21:23" />Amon kilame pecu mmau eh heciem riemlu delwe hegwangpei de pekatei pe ki gade teitsetti. <verse eid="2KI 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 21:24" />Dede hangdeu ga kebam mina ne hegwangpei Amon de mmau eh heciem riem kelamedung de teitsetti, nah penui pe napei Josiah de peu pe bam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 21:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 21:25" />Amon tei kegai ha kedadung, pa tei kedidung, cidungde Judah gwangpei hakwak gage raupwa la meluini? <verse eid="2KI 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 21:26" />Minadung pecu Uzza gurie pe rau gage kungdi, nah pe napei Josiah pebam leu eh hegwang teidi.<verse eid="2KI 21:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="2KI 22" />
  <para style="s">Hezai Laisiukwak Ngaukelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 22:1" />Josiah hegwang tei kelu dau pa mmi heset di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi camreieket hegwangtei. Pepui zi cai Jedidah (pa cai Bozkathme Adaiah napui). <verse eid="2KI 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 22:2" />Pa RAMPAUBE miakngau gade dai petaubi teilu. Pa pe pau David zai pelane mzuilu, nah pa zetle ge mede hile ge nreugai dima.<verse eid="2KI 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 22:3" />Cinzwa eh hegwangpei Josiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum, Azaliah napei Meshullam capei Shaphan, keraube de, pa RAMPAUBE ki gage langgai eh ranggai, <verse eid="2KI 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 22:4" />“Cingku kedibe Hilkiah da hang cuh nah pecu rangbeu lu RAMPAUBE ki ga rangkang pwalwet kebam de pei kera, kerecaki kekwame ne minadung dade hekwa kelube. <verse eid="2KI 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 22:5" />Cide makam keteime RAMPAUBE ki pie rengei kebamme ba gage peu beulu, nah cide penuide peu RAMPAUBE ki ga kebamme makam keteime de peulu, penuide peu kerecaki sia kebam retaklu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 22:6" />Penuide peu rangkang peulu tsingta keteime, ki keteime, nah tangtsuta keteime de, nah tangtsu pang nah tsing lui kera ziemne de, kerecaki retak kerane.” <verse eid="2KI 22:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 22:7" />Dede penuide rangkang peu kegaidung de rau ma, kedanemene penui cide masang eh keu hetatei kelune.<verse eid="2KI 22:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 22:8" />Hilkiah cingku kedibe Shaphan keraube dage rang, “Ih RAMPAUBE ki gade hezai laisiukwak de ngaulu.” Cine Hilkiah laisiukwak de Shaphan dage peudi, nah pa cide pei gai. <verse eid="2KI 22:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 22:9" />Shaphan hegwangpei da laisiukwak de keulwe mie, nah pecu pau de beu eh ranggai, “N kilamedung rangkang de luteu dida kerecaki gade ngau kelu de nah penui cide peu dida RAMPAUBE ki pie rengei eh kwakebamme makam keteime ba gage.” <verse eid="2KI 22:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 22:10" />Pecai keraube Shaphan hegwangpei dage rangdi, “Hilkiah cingku kedibe acu laisiukwak ge pwa peu.” Pecai Shaphan hegwangpei dage cide pei gaibeu. <verse eid="2KI 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 22:11" />Cinzwa eh hegwangpei hezai samdung de siulu ge, pa pe paini hietdi. <verse eid="2KI 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 22:12" />Hegwangpei cingkupei Hilkiah, Shaphan napei Ahikam, Micaiah napei Akbor, keraube Shaphan, nah Asaiah, pe kilabe de aja kai eh ranggai, <verse eid="2KI 22:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 22:13" />“Mie delwe RAMPAUBE de ngngwa mpaulo a ziemne, nah mina ziemne nah Judah pelane ziemne, laisiukwak aide gade samdung ngau kelu de ziemne. RAMPAUBE anuide pe ratasüt bam dida kedanemene anui paume aipau laisiukwak samdung anuide mzai lulo rau kenzeu leune tei mzailu kemakne.”<verse eid="2KI 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 22:14" />Cine cingkupei Hilkiah, Ahikam, Akbor, Shaphan, nah Asaiah caihakecibepui Huldah da mie, Tikvah napei Harhas capei Shallum nau, paiheni kerengeibe (pa Jerusalem keheci lebie lunghla), nah penui pecu ngngwa mpau. <verse eid="2KI 22:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 22:15" />Pa penui dage rangdi, “Aide RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang ne ranggai: ‘A dage ncu langkegaibe pei de rangbeu, <verse eid="2KI 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 22:16" />“Aide RAMPAUBE rangzeu: ‘Pielo, Ih heni aide nah cika lunghkebam pelane da kengkap teugwang beuzie, Judah gwangpei pwapei kelu laisiukwak ga raupwa kela leune nzwa eh. <verse eid="2KI 22:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 22:17" />Kedanemene penui acu gidi eh hera kedadung dage perim kehengui rugai di, iciu eh penui a rata teidi penui teikegai tahdung pelane le, ciziemne heni aide de mlai eh a rata cuh dida, nah cide nghim di lakta.’” <verse eid="2KI 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 22:18" />Dede Judah gwangpei da, RAMPAUBE lungning keteu kera ncu langkegaibe, aide nang pe dage rang zie: “RAMPAUBE, Israel Tinggwang aide rangla: ‘Nang siu kelu samdung de, <verse eid="2KI 22:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 22:19" />n mlung nciep kecu ziemne, nah RAMPAUBE dwade ncu tei hena kelu ziemne, heni aide nah cika lungkebamme de mlai eh Ih rang kegai nang siu kelu dau, penuide kemtage teidi kera nah reset pung eh, nah nang n painidung hietdi nah a dwade hap kegai ziemne, Ih de n kwa kingnei da, aide RAMPAUBE ne ndu kegai. <verse eid="2KI 22:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 22:20" />Pielo, Ih ncu n paume dage kaibeu zie, nah nang lungciep gade n rau ga gwanglu zie. Ih kengkap heni aide ga kaigai lai kebam pelane nang ngau canglak.’”’” Cine minadung sam aide teu eh hegwangpei da cailigwang.<verse eid="2KI 22:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="2KI 23" />
  <para style="s">Josiah Samkak Teihecikelu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 23:1" />Cine hegwangpei, samgwame de langgai eh penui Judah nah Jerusalem ga hangkiame pelane de pe dage qu hekwa gailu. <verse eid="2KI 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 23:2" />Ge hegwangpei, Judah ga minadung pelane nah Jerusalem ga kelungme pelane, nah cingkume, caihakecime nah minadung pelane, keceu gade kedi kecang pecu nzang eh RAMPAUBE ki ga hangdi. Cidau pa, RAMPAUBE ki gade ngau kelu Samkak laisiukwak samria pekiene penui kangbau kebam gade peigai. <verse eid="2KI 23:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 23:3" />Hegwangpei kipi ga saplu delwe RAMPAUBE dwa gade samkaklu, pe mlung pelane nah pe keringria pelane teu eh RAMPAUBE caisui kera nah pe ajadung mnei kera, pe zaidung mzai kera, samkakkelu aipau samdung de aipau laisiukwak ga raupwa kebam de teicanglu kerane. Ciu eh mina pelane samkakkelu de mzai kera sampetlu.<verse eid="2KI 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 23:4" />Hegwangpei cingku kedibe Hilkiah, pe kangga kebam cingkumedung, nah kirieki kwa kebammedung de RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade Baal nah Asherah de, nah tinggim ga hegidung leune de teu kereca niadung pelane keu mpetti lo aja kaigai. Pa cidungde Jerusalem gwale luhdung ga Kidron langkam gage rudi delwe pe mimütdung Bethel gage pwa gaidi. <verse eid="2KI 23:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 23:5" />Pa mamie kereca cingkumedung Judah gwangpeidung ne peu Judah namdidung ga nah Jerusalem taigadung ga nlum kemakme reca bamdung ga perim kehengui ru kera kedet kelumedung de keu mpetti, Baal de, tingnaimiak, hekei, kideudung de, nah tinggim gidung pelane de kehengui rugai kebeume de. <verse eid="2KI 23:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 23:6" />Pa RAMPAUBE kerecaki gade Asherah mie keu mpetti, Jerusalem gwale Kidron langkam gage delwe cide cikage rudi. Pa cide teikecai pwa rebui teidi delwe cipau rebui de mteibena raukie gage teizangra gai di. <verse eid="2KI 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 23:7" />Pa RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga kebam kerecaki helipeidung kibungdung, mipuidung Asherah ziemne painidung dak kela bungde tei gidi. <verse eid="2KI 23:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 23:8" />Josiah Judah namdidung gade cingkume pelane de ngngwa gwanglu delwe cingkumedung kehengui ru kela recabam dungde tei heradi, Geba gade Beersheba kecang. Pa heriekidung ga kereca nidung Joshua rieki (deuceudibe) kimui ga kebam dungde teingkap di, namdi rieki hile kebamde. <verse eid="2KI 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 23:9" />Cipau recabamdung cingkume dungde peu Jerusalem ga RAMPAUBE recabam ga hegwa tei kera peu meliede, penui cehikaikemak tangku de penui sinamedung de ngngwa tyei. <verse eid="2KI 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 23:10" />Josiah Ben Hinnom langkam ga kebam Topheth de tei heradi, ciu eh peu mige dede pe napei mede pe napui de peu Molech dage keru ratak ge tei eh mi gage rugai melu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 23:11" />Pa Judah gwangpeidung tingnaimiak dage reca tei mci gai kedi kündung de keu mpetti. Cidungde RAMPAUBE kerecaki kigu taiga bam, ki kerengei kedibe, Nathan-Melek kibung taiga. Josiah tingnaimiak dage reca teibeu kedi hekwen garidung de rudi. <verse eid="2KI 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 23:12" />Judah gwangpeidung ne tei kelu, Ahaz kibung nreube kipeureu ga recabamdung kebamdung de hegwangpei Josiah tei msiadi, nah RAMPAUBE kerecaki kigu kena ga Manasseh ne tei kegai recabamdung de si eh. Josiah cidungde rüt kecaigidi delwe cidungde Kidron langkam gage kelien gidi. <verse eid="2KI 23:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 23:13" />Hegwangpei Jerusalem naimiak kepetlebie mcikemak deutu ga kebam kereca nidung Israel gwangpei Solomon ne Sidonme kemneeu mie Ashtoreth ziemne tei pwa kebamdung de tei msiadi; Moabme kemneu mie Chemosh ziemne, nah Ammonme kemneeu mie Molech ziemne tei keludung de. <verse eid="2KI 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 23:14" />Pa tangtsu tsiadung de tei takcaidi nah Asherah miedung de teingkaudi delwe pa cipau nidung de mina rahdung le tei puidi.<verse eid="2KI 23:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 23:15" />Josiah Bethel ga kebam recabam de nah kereca ni Jeroboam Nebat napei (Israelme de kemau gage ngngwa kegaibe) ne tei kelude de teingkap ciakdti. Pa cipau recabam de nah kereca ni de de rudi delwe cide rütkecai pwa rebui teidi. Pa Asherah mie de si eh rudi. <verse eid="2KI 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 23:16" />Pecai Josiah pie twagwa kegai dau, pa hangdeutu reuga kebam heraudung de ngau. Pa mina rahdung heraudung gade keu mpet kerane minadung de langgai; delwe pa cidungde recabam gage rudi, ainzwa eh pa recabam de tei heradi. Aide Tinggwang minabe rang kegai RAMPAUBE sam, aidungde mrai rang nswa kegaibe de. <verse eid="2KI 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 23:17" />Pecai pa rangdi, “Ih kengau de cau rau no?” Ge namdi minadung pe sam keligai, “Cide Tinggwang minabe, Judah gade gwang eh nang Bethel recabam tei nsia kedi aidungde mrai rang kebeube rau lie.” <verse eid="2KI 23:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 23:18" />Cine Josiah rangdi, “Cide peu bamlu. Migede pe rahdung li kelai lak.” Cine penui pe rah nah Samaria gade kegwang caihakecibe rahdung deu keli tadi. <verse eid="2KI 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 23:19" />Pecai Josiah Samaria namdidung ga nlumkemak reca nidung ga kebam kidung pelane radi, cide Israel gwangpeidung ne tei kegaide, nah cide ne RAMPAUBE rata tei di. Pa Bethel ga tei kegai nzwa eh penui dage teigai. <verse eid="2KI 23:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 23:20" />Pa kerecabamdung ga bata ketei cingkume pelane de recabamdung gage gi gai nah pa penui reu gage mina rahdung pwa ru gai. Pecai pa Jerusalem ga cailigwangdi.<verse eid="2KI 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 23:21" />Pecai hegwangpei mina pelane dage aja kai eh ranggai, “Samkakkelu laisiukwak aipau de ga raupwa kela nzwa, kahkegwangngyi de RAMPAUBE n Tinggwang de kerüt gade mnei lulo.” <verse eid="2KI 23:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 23:22" />Tutiakme ne Israelme de teu kegwangting gade, mede Israel mede Judah gwangpeidung tingdau leune ga cikenzwa Kahkegwangngyi madaude hengyi mereu. <verse eid="2KI 23:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 23:23" />Dede hegwangpei Josiah hegwang tei kelu mmi kereieheset bekum RAMPAUBE Kahkegwangngyi aide Jerusalem gade hengyilu.<verse eid="2KI 23:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 23:24" />Josiah ketsaime de mede rabe dungde mpau kelame desi eh gwagi di. Pa rekaniadung, mamiedung, nah kemneu niadung pelane Judah deu ga nah Jerusalem ga kebam pelane keu gidi, iciu eh cingkupei Hilkiah RAMPAUBE Kerecaki gade ngau kelu laisiukwak ga hezai samdung raupwa kela de teicanglu kerane. <verse eid="2KI 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 23:25" />Josiah dwale pa nzwa hegwang gede gah, pe mlung pelane, pe keringria pelane, nah pe kengking pelane teu eh RAMPAUBE da kegwang, nah Moses zai pelane mzai kelu. Mede Josiah nzwa hegwang gede pecai cuh luma.<verse eid="2KI 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 23:26" />Iciude, Manasseh RAMPAUBE rata tei eh bata kesiadung tei kegai leune ziemne Judah de mmau eh RAMPAUBE pe rata süt kebam de gade nghim dima. <verse eid="2KI 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 23:27" />Cine RAMPAUBE rangdi, “Ih Israel de a dwa gade keugi kedi nzwa Ih Judah de de keugi dizie, nah Ih kedet kelu Jerusalem, namdi aide, nah Ih ‘A zi cika bamzie’ de kebeu ki de de keu gidi zie.”<verse eid="2KI 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 23:28" />Josiah tei kegai ha kedadung, pa tei kegai leunedung, cidungde Judah gwangpeidung hakwak ga raupwa bam meluini? <verse eid="2KI 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 23:29" />Pa hegwang ketei tingdau, Egypt gwangpei Pharaoh Necho, Euphrates Reuki gade Assyria gwangpei de regi kera mie. Hegwangpei Josiah Necho de hereu gade redau kera mie, nah Necho ne pecu Megiddo gade teitsetti. <verse eid="2KI 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 23:30" />Josiah kilamedung, pe paau Megiddo gade bagi ge gage punglwe Jerusalem ga pung gwanglu, delwe pe rau gage pecu kungdi. Pecai Judah ga minadung Josiah napei Jehoahaz de ngngwalu, pecu keniaklu delwe peu pe bam leu eh pecu hegwang teilu.<verse eid="2KI 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="2KI 23:31" />Jehoahaz hegwang tei kelu dau pa mmi ngkaiekecum di, nah pa Jerusalem ga keicum hegwang tei. Pepui zi cai Hamutal; pa Libnah gade kegwang Jeremiah napui. <verse eid="2KI 23:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="2KI 23:32" />Jehoahaz RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau teidi, pe paume tei kegwang leune nzwa eh. <verse eid="2KI 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="2KI 23:33" />Pharaoh Necho Hamath deu Riblah gade pecu hebaangki gage kaidi, iciu eh pa Jerusalem ga hegwang tei melu kerane. Pecai Necho Judahme de peu heraha rangkanggeu talent haige nah kecak talent ket<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">23:33 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">rangkanggeu kilogram 3,400 nah kecak kilogram 34.</char></note> suh. <verse eid="2KI 23:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="2KI 23:34" />Pharaoh Necho Josiah napei Eliakim de peu pe pei Josiah bam leu eh hegwangpei teilu, delwe pezi msiak lipwa Jehoiakim teidi. Dede pa Jehoahaz de Egypt ga ngngwa mie di, nah Jehoahaz cika de tsaidi. <verse eid="2KI 23:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="2KI 23:35" />Jehoiakim rangkanggeu nah kecak de Pharaoh de ha beu. Pharaoh kie kebam heraha de teicanglu kerane, Jehoiakim minadung dade heraha ha nah pa hangdeu ga minadung de kemei tei eh peu rangkanggeu nah kecak penui mabam rehi gade peu pwa pecu peu.<verse eid="2KI 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah Gwangpei Jehoiakim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="2KI 23:36" />Jehoiakim pa hegwang tei keludau pa mmi ngkaiemengei di, nah pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieket hegwang tei. Pepui zi cai Zebidah; pa au Rumah gade kegwang Pedaiah napui. <verse eid="2KI 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="2KI 23:37" />Jehoiakim RAMPAUBE miakngau gade kemau leu teidi, pe paume tei kegwang nzwa eh.<verse eid="2KI 23:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="2KI 24" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 24:1" />Jehoiakim hegwang ketei tingdau, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar Judah de gwaketang lüt; Jehoiakim pe kila tei mmi kecum ziemne. Pecai Jehoiakim nreulu nah Nebuchadnezzar de renia di. <verse eid="2KI 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 24:2" />RAMPAUBE Jehoiakim de renia eh langgai Chaldeanme, Aramme, Moabme, nah Ammonme maadung de; Pa Judah de renia eh ngkapdi kerane penuide langgai. Aide RAMPAUBE sam pe kilame caihakecime dade teigai zielie rang kebeude nzwa eh. <verse eid="2KI 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 24:3" />RAMPAUBE ne rangkebeu gade aide Judah ga gwang zeuda, pe dwa gade penuide keugidi kerane, Manasseh maudung ziemne, pa tei kedidung leune ziemne,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="ft" closed="false">Kesa laisiukwak ga, </char><char style="fqa">Cide au RAMPAUBE lunghop ziemne da. </char> </note> <verse eid="2KI 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 24:4" />nah pa maukemakme jai teilwa kedine de, kedanemene pa maukemakme jai le Jerusalem teipui di. RAMPAUBE cipau maude gibeuneu tadi. <verse eid="2KI 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 24:5" />Jehoiakim ha kedadung, nah pa tei kegai leune, cidungde Judah gwangpeidung ha kwak gage rau pwabam meni? <verse eid="2KI 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 24:6" />Jehoiakim tsai dige, pe napei Jehoiachin ne pebam leu eh hegwang teilu. <verse eid="2KI 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 24:7" />Egypt gwangpei pe deu gwale pet eh gwaketang si tadi, kedanemene Babylon gwangpei ne Egypt gwangpei kangga kebam deudung pelane kezeu pwadi kecune, Egypt reuceuna gade Euphrates Reuki ga kecang.<verse eid="2KI 24:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Jehoiachin</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 24:8" />Jehoiachin hegwang tei keludau pa mmi kereieheset di; pa Jerusalem ga keicum hegwangtei. Pe pui zi cai Nehushta; pa becai Jerusalemme Elnathan napui. <verse eid="2KI 24:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 24:9" />Pa RAMPAUBE dwade dai maubi kecube teidi; pe pei teikedi leune pa teidi.<verse eid="2KI 24:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 24:10" />Cipau tingdau Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar reugwame Jerusalem de gwaketang nah namdi de twagwalu. <verse eid="2KI 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 24:11" />Pe reugwame twagwa kebamdau Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar namdi ga lüt, <verse eid="2KI 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 24:12" />nah Judah gwangpei Jehoiachin, pa, pe pui, pe kilame, pe hegwangki ga kedime, nah pe kangga kedimedung de ngngwa Babylon gwangpei kangga nlütdi. Babylon gwangpei pa hegwang teikelu mmi heset bekum pecu tuilu. <verse eid="2KI 24:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 24:13" />Nebuchadnezzar RAMPAUBE kerecaki ga maniadung pemi kehung pelane cikade keumpet lu, nah hegwangki ga kebam dungde de. Israel gwangpei Solomon ne kerecaki ga kecak niadung tei kegaide pa dang kecaidi, RAMPAUBE mrai rangpwa kela nzwa eh. <verse eid="2KI 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 24:14" />Pa Jerusalem pelane, muiteume pelane, nah reugwame pelane, hebaangme cangkerei, nah bata tei kecime pelane nah hegeu kerekime de langgi di. Migede de püt nzeu dima hangdeube ga ma gahtume de gwale. <verse eid="2KI 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 24:15" />Nebuchadnezzar Jehoiachin de Babylon gage langgidi, hegwangpei pui, pe naudung, kedime, nah hangdeu reu kedimedung desi eh. Pa penuide Jerusalem gade Babylon gage langgi di. <verse eid="2KI 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 24:16" />Reugwame pelane, cang hena ge, nah bata tei kecime cangge, nah hegeu kerekime, penui pelane regi lu kebuime, Babylon gwangpei mipei aidungde de ngngwa gwang Babylon gage langgi di. <verse eid="2KI 24:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 24:17" />Babylon gwangpei, Jehoiachin pei sinabe Mattaniah de peu pebam leu eh hegwang teilu, nah pezi msiak lipwa Zedekiah teidi.<verse eid="2KI 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="s">Judah gwangpei Zedekiah</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 24:18" />Zedekiah hegwang tei keludau pa mmi ngkaieket di; pa Jerusalem ga mmi kereieket hegwangtei. Pe pui zi cai Hamutal; pa cai Libnah gade kegwang Jeremiah napui. <verse eid="2KI 24:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 24:19" />Pa RAMPAUBE dwade dai maubi kecube tei; Jehoiakim teigwang kedi leune pa teidi. <verse eid="2KI 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 24:20" />RAMPAUBE rata gade, ma aidung leune teikedi tei Jerusalem nah Judah ga, pa penuide pedwa gade langgi di kemaktane. Pecai Zedekiah Babylon gwangpei de renia di.<verse eid="2KI 24:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 24" />
  <chapter number="25" style="c" sid="2KI 25" />
  <para style="s">Jerusalem kaukedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2KI 25:1" />Hegwangpei Zedekiah hegwang ketei mmi hekui bekum, kei kerei bekei, nah ziangrei benai, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar pe reugwame pelane de ngngwa lwe Jerusalem de gwaketang. Pa cide kemcwa gage ramzeuki teilu, nah penui gwa kera herie ge tei tegwalu. <verse eid="2KI 25:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2KI 25:2" />Cine namdi de Hegwangpei Zedekiah hegwang ketei mmi kereieket kecang twagwa pwa bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2KI 25:3" />Cipau kum kei mdei bekei lang hekuine benai, namdi de ga herakum kumsüt di eh cika lungh kebamme ziemne ketyeipok kette gahdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2KI 25:4" />Ge namdi de pungpop lütlu, nah reugwame pelane tingmui gage hegwangpei gurie lede, herie kena kakga kebam kirie lampui lede pakdi, Chaldeanme namdi pelane twagwa pwabam liede. Hegwangpei Arabah lambie ge tet gaidi. <verse eid="2KI 25:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2KI 25:5" />Dede Chaldeame reugwame Hegwangpei Zedekiah de gwazui mie nah pecu Jericho taiga Jordan Reuki langkam langkie de gade gwa canglu. Pe reugwame pelane pe dade zangra tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2KI 25:6" />Penui hegwangpei de tuilu delwe pecu Babylon gwangpei da Riblah ga ngngwa hanglu, cikade penui pe ha tiaklu. <verse eid="2KI 25:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2KI 25:7" />Zedekiah napei dungde au, penui pa kengau dwa gade penuide gitsetdi. Pecai pa pe miak kenade letmpet lu, hetageu riadungle pecu kangdi, delwe pecu Babylon ga ngngwa gwanglu.<verse eid="2KI 25:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2KI 25:8" />Kei mengei bekei, lang henane benai, cide Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar hegwang ketei mmi kereiehekui bekum, Babylon gwangpei kilabe ge nah pe pumkwame muibe, Nebuzaradan, Jerusalem ga gwanglu. <verse eid="2KI 25:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2KI 25:9" />Pa RAMPAUBE kerecaki, hegwangki, nah Jerusalem ga kidung pelane rudi; namdi ga ki kemlang leune si eh pa rudi. <verse eid="2KI 25:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2KI 25:10" />Jerusalem de twagwa kebam heriedung pelane de, Babylonme reugwame pumkwame muibe kangga kebamme pelane ne cidungde teimsia di. <verse eid="2KI 25:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2KI 25:11" />Namdi ga bangpwa kebamme minadung pelane, Babylon gwangpei dage pakgai kedimedung, nah bang kebam minadung de, pumkwame reu muibe, Nebuzaradan ne penuide ngngwa tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2KI 25:12" />Dede pumkwame muibe hangdeu ga magahtume kesa de kai nzeu di peu kubeluhdung nah luhdung ga mata tei kerane. <verse eid="2KI 25:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2KI 25:13" />Hetageu tsiadung RAMPAUBE ki ga kebam de, nah ma bamdung nah hetageu jaaidi de RAMPAUBE ki ga kebamdung de, Chaldeanme ne cidungde teipang takcaidi delwe hetageu de Babylon ga pung caili gwangdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2KI 25:14" />Lidung, peitwakdung, mitaubung teikemmüt tie, hepiaktiadung, nah hetageu lidung pelane cingkume pwa kerecaki ga teu heta teibam kela de, Chaldeanme cidung de peciakne keu tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2KI 25:15" />Mimüt keu mpet kela lidung nah kecak le tei kelu kwakdung, nah rangkanggeu le tei keludung, hegwangpei reket kedibe cidung de de keu tetdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2KI 25:16" />Solomon RAMPAUBE ki ziemne tei kegai, tsiapum kenade, jaaidi de, nah ma bamdung de hetageu kekieege mdet kera rüt süt kecu kaipwa bam. <verse eid="2KI 25:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2KI 25:17" />Tsiapum keraide pehu cubit kereieheset,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre 8.3</char></note> nah petün ga hetageu peukang ge bam. Peukang de pehu cubit kecum,<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">25:17 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">metre 1.3</char></note> marak kedak rehi ge nah kuraletsi kai twagwa lu peukang gage, pelane hetageule teilu. Tsiapum keda de nah marak kedak rehi de keraide nzwakap da. <verse eid="2KI 25:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2KI 25:18" />Pumkwame muibe cingku kedibe Seraiah, cingku pe kenabe Zephaniah desi eh, nah herieki kekwame hangcum de ngngwa teudi. <verse eid="2KI 25:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2KI 25:19" />Namdi gade pa kedime ge reugwame de rengei kebambe de, nah namdi ga kebam hegwangpei de keledeume hang mengei de hebaang tei kera ngngwalu. Pa hegwangpei reugwame reu kedibe mina dungde reugwame tei kera hezi keraube de de, nah hangdeu gade minadung kemlangme namdi ga kebamme riakherok desi eh hebaang tei kera ngngwalu. <verse eid="2KI 25:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2KI 25:20" />Pecai pumkwame muibe, Nebuzaradan, penuide ngngwalu delwe Riblah ga Babylon hegwangpei da penuide ngngwa gwanglu. <verse eid="2KI 25:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2KI 25:21" />Babylon gwangpei penui de Hamath deu Riblah gade teitset di. Ainzwa eh, Judah pe deu gade langgi kedi gage mpetdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2KI 25:22" />Judah deu ga bang kebammedung, Babylon gwangpei Nebuchadnezzar ne gi nzeu kebeumedung, pa Shaphan capei, Ahikam napei, Gedaliah de penuide pierengei kera kailu. <verse eid="2KI 25:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2KI 25:23" />Reugwame muibedung pelane, penui nah penui minadung, Babylon gwangpei Gedaliah de deuceudibe teidi delie kecu siu luge, penui Mizpah ga Gedaliah da mie. Mina aidungde cai Nethaniah napei Ishmael, Kareah napei Johanan, Netophah gade kegwang Tanhumeth napei Seraiah, nah Maakathme pei Jaazaniah kegwang, penui nah penui minadung. <verse eid="2KI 25:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2KI 25:24" />Gedaliah penui da nah penui minadung da sampetgai, nah penui dage ranggai, “Chaldeanme kedimedung de hing diso. Hangdeu dega lunghlu nah Babylon gwangpei gwatei lu, ciciu lude nnui ziemne yi luzie.” <verse eid="2KI 25:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2KI 25:25" />Dede kei hena bekei Nethaniah napei Ishmael, Elishama tsapei, hegwang kelak gade, mina hang kerei de ngngwalwe gwang nah Gedaliah de gwaketang. Gedaliah nah Judah ga minadung nah Babylonme pecu Mizpah ga ngngwa kebamme desi eh tsaidi. <verse eid="2KI 25:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2KI 25:26" />Pecai minadung pelane, keceu gade kedi kecang, nah reugwame muidung, cuhlu delwe Egypt ga miedi, kedanemene penui Babylonme de hing kedine.<verse eid="2KI 25:26" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jehoiachin de lungmpet kedi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="2KI 25:27" />Judah gwangpei Jehoiachin de langgi kedi mmi camreiehena bekum, kei kereiekenabe kei, hekeizie ngkaiehena benai caine, Babylon gwangpei Awel-Marduk Judah gwangpei Jehoiachin de hebaangki gade lungmpet beu. Awel-Marduk hegwang teicuh kelu bekum aide teidi. <verse eid="2KI 25:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="2KI 25:28" />Pa pecu pe zaiyi eh mpaugai nah Babylon ga pecu ngngwa kela hegwangmedung kedame gu swade herüt peugwa kecu bam pwapeu. <verse eid="2KI 25:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="2KI 25:29" />Awel-Marduk Jehoiachin hebaangki painidung lwakdi, nah Jehoiachin pe teilung pelane hegwangpei gu taktyeibam gade matyei mui bamdi. <verse eid="2KI 25:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="2KI 25:30" />Ketyeipok teu maikesia tingba ramsang pe teilung zie pelane pecu pwapeu.<verse eid="2KI 25:30" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2KI 25" />
</usx>